b0bf7ebd-d8b3-4b66-ba3a-2a0e7eed49f5	2026-07-03 09:57:21.228192+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.228192+00	32	# **Công dụng**\n\nKhi sử dụng cùng **điếu ngải cứu NaHerbs**, nguồn nhiệt kết hợp với hương thơm từ thảo dược giúp:\n\n* **Giảm đau và căng cơ:** Nhiệt nóng giúp thư giãn cơ bắp, giảm đau nhức cổ vai gáy, đau lưng, tê bì chân tay hoặc các vết bầm tím.   \n* **Kích thích tuần hoàn máu:** Hơi ấm làm giãn nở mạch máu, giúp khí huyết lưu thông tốt hơn, từ đó tăng cường trao đổi chất và phục hồi sức khỏe.   \n* **Bổ sung dương khí và trừ hàn:** Theo Y học cổ truyền, liệu pháp này giúp đẩy lùi hàn khí (lạnh) ra khỏi cơ thể, hỗ trợ trị cảm lạnh và giảm đau bụng kinh.  \n* **Thư giãn, giảm stress:** Hương thơm tự nhiên từ ngải cứu giúp làm dịu tâm trí, giảm căng thẳng và hỗ trợ cải thiện chất lượng giấc ngủ.	[-0.030181885,0.0011262894,-0.012382507,0.005180359,0.0390625,-0.048187256,-0.06719971,0.036834717,0.021942139,-0.02267456,-0.03616333,0.05029297,-0.031402588,0.011398315,0.02508545,0.022079468,-0.028396606,0.0047454834,-0.020858765,-0.016357422,-7.266998E-4,0.0725708,0.036468506,0.023117065,0.040130615,-0.027496338,0.00233078,0.03555298,0.04083252,-0.022583008,-0.018432617,-0.028244019,0.036010742,-0.004508972,0.014961243,0.065979004,0.00907135,-5.364418E-4,-0.035614014,-0.051330566,0.011253357,-0.01979065,-0.02041626,0.02558899,-0.04385376,0.01638794,-0.022598267,-9.293556E-4,0.022949219,0.014717102,0.018035889,-0.031707764,-0.010314941,0.03540039,0.014381409,-0.010894775,0.00381279,0.039733887,-0.017684937,-0.025680542,-0.023345947,-0.03604126,-0.002494812,0.037109375,-0.044006348,0.02720642,0.021697998,-0.07598877,-0.010391235,0.014312744,-0.02192688,0.008964539,0.033111572,0.030792236,0.0041160583,-0.0055389404,-0.030715942,0.003238678,0.016311646,-0.038879395,-0.0129470825,0.0087509155,2.2363663E-4,0.0062713623,0.015701294,-0.05203247,-0.041259766,0.052642822,-0.07659912,0.0062789917,-0.011459351,0.021652222,0.024414062,-0.021102905,0.017456055,0.012802124,-0.00100