c585ba98-5711-4e52-86a8-727fe4718e5d	2026-07-03 09:57:21.229028+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.229028+00	38	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Bịt Mắt Thảo Dược NaHerbs** được thiết kế nhằm mang đến cảm giác thư giãn cho vùng mắt sau những giờ làm việc, học tập hoặc sử dụng thiết bị điện tử trong thời gian dài.\n\nBên trong sản phẩm là **100% thảo dược thiên nhiên**, kết hợp cùng lớp vải mềm mại, thân thiện với làn da, giúp mang lại hương thơm dịu nhẹ và cảm giác dễ chịu trong suốt quá trình sử dụng.\n\nSản phẩm có thể sử dụng trực tiếp hoặc **làm ấm bằng lò vi sóng, nồi cơm hoặc các nguồn nhiệt phù hợp** trước khi đắp lên mắt để tăng cảm giác thư giãn. Ngoài ra, người dùng cũng có thể làm lạnh trong ngăn mát hoặc ngăn đá theo nhu cầu.\n\nBịt mắt được thiết kế với **dây đeo co giãn**, ôm vừa vặn nhiều kích cỡ đầu, mang lại sự thoải mái khi nghỉ ngơi, ngủ trưa hoặc thư giãn tại nhà.	[-0.013374329,0.02558899,-0.08685303,0.013923645,0.045532227,-0.020202637,-0.013748169,0.025909424,0.01737976,-0.03692627,-0.014472961,-0.019058228,-0.011116028,-0.031799316,0.027557373,0.014503479,0.009590149,-0.018737793,-0.047973633,0.0023708344,0.051086426,0.068603516,0.008384705,0.0052337646,0.043121338,-0.044525146,0.038116455,0.019622803,0.012763977,-0.00680542,-0.04928589,-0.028686523,0.04373169,-0.012771606,0.047668457,0.03213501,-0.005115509,0.027053833,-0.032318115,-0.053894043,-0.01574707,-0.02067566,-0.042877197,0.023605347,-0.02293396,0.003156662,-0.007472992,0.052246094,0.02015686,-0.01285553,-0.016403198,-0.012321472,-0.041015625,0.037384033,-0.016281128,-0.013999939,-0.01876831,0.035064697,-0.006587982,0.021774292,-0.0107803345,-0.029907227,0.010559082,0.07080078,-0.079589844,-0.0047454834,-0.011947632,-0.07080078,-0.009025574,0.00422287,0.03111267,-0.028869629,-0.010292053,0.030731201,-0.009216309,-0.020645142,-0.035583496,-0.024017334,0.01927185,-0.008026123,-0.0033340454,0.008087158,-9.446144E-4,-0.0044288635,-0.025238037,-0.05621338,-0.044952393,0.018463135,-0.074645996,-0.009979248,-