411736f5-bd96-433e-879d-483c3512410d	2026-07-03 09:57:21.229703+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.229703+00	43	# **Hướng dẫn sử dụng**\n\n### **Chườm nóng**\n\n* Làm nóng sản phẩm bằng **lò vi sóng, nồi cơm hoặc nguồn nhiệt phù hợp**.  \n* Kiểm tra nhiệt độ trước khi sử dụng.  \n* Đắp lên mắt khoảng **10–15 phút** để thư giãn.\n\n### **Chườm lạnh**\n\n* Cho sản phẩm vào túi zip kín.  \n* Đặt trong ngăn mát hoặc ngăn đá từ **30 phút đến 1 giờ**.  \n* Đắp lên mắt khi cần thư giãn.	[0.0061569214,0.0062942505,-0.062805176,-0.04244995,0.042510986,-0.034454346,0.0031547546,-0.027923584,0.042907715,-0.061462402,-0.040222168,0.0104522705,-0.019958496,0.017593384,0.012130737,0.014633179,-0.041290283,0.008392334,-0.00843811,0.0066108704,-0.025527954,0.060028076,-0.011291504,0.05230713,0.022018433,0.033203125,-0.00466156,0.04043579,0.032562256,-0.05581665,-0.060424805,-0.018753052,0.024124146,-0.0029697418,0.049591064,0.048553467,-0.022125244,0.032684326,-0.023727417,-0.023651123,-0.03250122,-0.04006958,-0.036254883,-0.016815186,0.0178833,0.021026611,-0.04928589,0.016052246,0.013946533,-0.0030345917,0.070617676,0.0037021637,-0.0017089844,0.004173279,0.0071868896,-0.013549805,0.03878784,0.0061836243,0.033050537,0.019165039,-0.006248474,-0.028564453,0.030975342,0.037841797,-0.0020713806,-0.025039673,-0.012535095,-0.027267456,-0.015029907,0.0138168335,-0.020355225,-0.021240234,0.024047852,-0.016189575,-0.017349243,0.036621094,-0.009498596,-0.033294678,0.04626465,-0.017227173,-0.018035889,0.017791748,0.02619934,0.038116455,-0.038116455,-0.032043457,-0.06677246,0.058135986,-0.06604004,-0.051940918,-0.033203125,0.05331421,0.017501831,-0.040100098,-0.010467529,0.02835083,0.004753113,-0.023513794,-0.00819397,0.046142578,0.034454346,0.017944336,0.01474762,-0.030975342,0.05178833,6.456375E-4,-0.020645142,0.013252258,-0.0715332,0.011016846,0.046173096,0.0075683594,0.010513306,0.02973938,0.002752304,0.061645508,0.03515625,0.02973938,0.0032787323,-0.04953003,-8.9740753E-4,-0.025299072,0.018096924,-0.