3704e59e-6046-4c85-949b-41f36c96bbce	2026-07-03 09:57:21.2304+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.2304+00	48	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Điếu Ngải Cứu NaHerbs** được làm từ **100% lá ngải cứu thiên nhiên** đã được sấy khô, nghiền mịn và cuộn chặt thành dạng điếu, phù hợp sử dụng trong các phương pháp chăm sóc sức khỏe theo y học cổ truyền.\n\nKhi được đốt cháy, điếu ngải tạo ra nguồn nhiệt ổn định kết hợp với hương thơm đặc trưng của ngải cứu, giúp mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và làm ấm cơ thể. Sản phẩm có thể sử dụng độc lập hoặc kết hợp với **Cốc Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu** và **Dụng Cụ Cầm Tay Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu NaHerbs**, giúp việc xông ngải trở nên thuận tiện và an toàn hơn.\n\nĐiếu được thiết kế với độ nén vừa phải, cháy đều, ít tàn, dễ thao tác và phù hợp cho nhu cầu chăm sóc sức khỏe tại nhà, spa hoặc các cơ sở y học cổ truyền.	[-0.010818481,-0.013587952,-0.049926758,8.2731247E-4,0.02684021,-0.04711914,-0.05368042,0.058624268,0.011001587,-0.028808594,0.008651733,-0.027252197,-0.0236969,-0.003194809,0.034118652,0.0060310364,-0.03640747,-0.015960693,-0.056671143,-0.004459381,0.0054740906,0.05178833,0.045318604,0.017852783,0.035125732,-0.042755127,0.031707764,0.046173096,0.039276123,-0.017730713,-0.0071907043,-0.024124146,0.03741455,0.009803772,0.022125244,0.035125732,0.01158905,-0.004234314,-0.028182983,-0.05709839,0.017562866,-0.022369385,-0.014457703,0.012283325,-0.0070381165,0.033447266,0.012481689,-0.018951416,0.023071289,-0.0067596436,0.016464233,-0.010826111,-0.027435303,0.008705139,0.0037574768,-4.208088E-4,-0.0061035156,0.058807373,-0.03564453,-0.026504517,8.8596344E-4,-0.05267334,0.007858276,0.025741577,-0.026931763,0.0035076141,-0.0071792603,-0.071899414,-0.019241333,-0.006175995,0.0103302,-0.011894226,-0.008720398,0.0231781,0.015541077,-0.009498596,-0.06011963,-0.0104599,0.024841309,-0.043304443,-0.0038642883,0.025726318,-0.0052871704,0.035614014,0.028579712,-0.040374756,-0.016021729,0.044128418,-0.045928955,0.014427185,-0.032318115,0.012420654,0.018081665,-0.03704834,0.0366