4fe9e9b8-64db-4586-b42c-87ee8ddf599e	2026-07-03 09:57:36.582403+00	2026-07-03 09:57:36.582403+00	52	# **Hướng dẫn sử dụng**\n\n1. Đốt cháy một đầu điếu ngải cứu.  \n2. Hơ cách bề mặt da khoảng **2–3 cm**, tránh để quá gần gây nóng rát.  \n3. Có thể giữ cố định tại vị trí cần chăm sóc hoặc di chuyển chậm theo vòng tròn, dọc theo vùng cơ hoặc huyệt đạo.  \n4. Sau khi sử dụng, dập tắt hoàn toàn điếu ngải trước khi cất giữ.\n\n**Lưu ý:** Để đảm bảo an toàn và thuận tiện, nên sử dụng cùng **Cốc Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu** hoặc **Dụng Cụ Cầm Tay Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu NaHerbs**.	[-0.004135132,1.989603E-4,-0.041778564,-0.031829834,0.039093018,-0.042816162,-0.04800415,0.0128479,-0.010108948,-0.034423828,1.4460087E-4,0.0011463165,-0.051696777,0.027023315,0.045928955,-0.015281677,-0.04724121,-0.012550354,-0.022537231,0.027191162,-0.06567383,0.0770874,0.041503906,0.03253174,0.018997192,-0.022628784,0.045532227,0.061309814,0.03161621,-0.009765625,-0.03744507,-0.01939392,0.007045746,-0.0146865845,0.024734497,0.047027588,0.014297485,0.009529114,-0.050720215,-0.035980225,0.010215759,-0.029327393,0.012298584,0.0019187927,0.011436462,0.020339966,-0.0021781921,-0.0056991577,0.035614014,-0.0035362244,0.05883789,-0.011070251,-0.015975952,0.07366943,-4.7326088E-5,-0.032196045,0.015838623,0.021697998,0.03253174,-0.0317688,-0.032318115,-0.027755737,0.014053345,0.030273438,-0.010345459,0.021362305,-0.029556274,-0.02468872,-0.01524353,-0.016082764,-0.018997192,-0.028442383,-0.011039734,-0.020050049,0.0079193115,0.0051002502,-0.055786133,-0.018554688,0.003314972,-0.028076172,-0.0046195984,9.3078613E-4,-0.022079468,0.028900146,-0.020065308,0.003446579,-0.03414917,0.030197144,-0.057678223,-0.016067505,-0.039031982,0.038970947,0.011367798,-0.034118652,0.019821167,0.030761719,0.016952515,-0.06137085,0.015281677,0.022766113,0.032714844,-0.0013751984,0.041931152,-0.021636963,0.025039673,-0.029876709,-0.024795532,0.049987793,-0.033325195,0.023498535,0.040252686,-0.018844604,0.035247803,0.02960205,-0.0016069412,