9009dc98-7246-4438-826c-28cc25c3c20d	2026-07-03 09:57:36.582996+00	2026-07-03 09:57:36.582996+00	56	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Áo Choàng Chữ U Thảo Dược NaHerbs** được thiết kế theo hình dáng chữ U ôm sát vùng **cổ, vai và gáy**, giúp tăng diện tích tiếp xúc và mang lại cảm giác thoải mái trong suốt quá trình sử dụng.\n\nSản phẩm có kích thước **37 × 52 cm**, phù hợp với nhiều vóc dáng, dễ dàng sử dụng khi làm việc, nghỉ ngơi hoặc thư giãn tại nhà.\n\nBên trong sản phẩm là **100% thảo dược thiên nhiên** được lựa chọn kỹ lưỡng, kết hợp cùng lớp vải mềm mại, tạo cảm giác dễ chịu khi tiếp xúc với da.\n\nĐể tăng hiệu quả sử dụng, người dùng có thể **làm nóng sản phẩm bằng lò vi sóng, nồi cơm, chảo hoặc các nguồn nhiệt phù hợp** trước khi sử dụng. Khi được làm ấm, hương thơm từ các loại thảo dược được lan tỏa tốt hơn, mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và dễ chịu.	[-0.009941101,-0.0017271042,-0.0473938,-0.005710602,0.049041748,-0.016464233,-0.046691895,0.01637268,0.021530151,-0.019378662,-0.036132812,-0.0037708282,-0.047943115,-0.033966064,0.035064697,0.011528015,0.0077400208,-0.019882202,-0.06060791,0.011962891,0.00756073,0.053527832,0.011260986,0.03842163,0.030197144,8.277893E-4,0.007873535,0.03213501,0.017944336,-0.010887146,-0.058441162,-0.017837524,0.05532837,-0.00844574,0.02229309,-0.005142212,0.0066184998,0.024719238,-0.011978149,-0.0491333,0.015716553,-2.0384789E-5,0.010620117,-0.028182983,-0.02998352,0.021713257,-0.019760132,0.044921875,0.016204834,-0.020614624,0.041931152,-4.6682358E-4,-0.044128418,0.02368164,-0.028930664,-0.024124146,-0.036468506,0.036895752,0.007080078,-0.0020923615,-0.030166626,-0.04598999,-0.011398315,0.050048828,-0.05618286,0.005126953,-0.019439697,-0.02230835,-0.0044403076,0.0074424744,0.002002716,-0.017471313,-0.016052246,0.02482605,0.018051147,-0.024887085,-0.078186035,-0.032348633,0.035247803,-0.010665894,-0.024154663,0.025177002,0.020339966,0.02619934,0.0037059784,-0.050201416,-0.05215454,0.02746582,-0.05291748,0.010879517,-0.010070801,0.01974