ab9a6814-a605-4d0d-9433-6abcef4bc6ef	2026-07-03 09:57:36.583444+00	2026-07-03 09:57:36.583444+00	59	# **Công dụng**\n\nKhi được làm nóng trước khi sử dụng, sản phẩm kết hợp giữa hơi ấm và hương thơm từ thảo dược thiên nhiên mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và dễ chịu.\n\nSản phẩm hỗ trợ:\n\n* Làm ấm vùng cổ, vai và gáy.  \n* Hỗ trợ giảm cảm giác đau mỏi và căng cứng cơ sau thời gian làm việc hoặc học tập.  \n* Giúp thư giãn vùng cổ vai gáy sau khi ngồi lâu hoặc ít vận động.  \n* Mang lại cảm giác dễ chịu nhờ hương thơm tự nhiên từ thảo dược.  \n* Có thể sử dụng tại nhà, văn phòng hoặc khi nghỉ ngơi.	[-0.0029201508,-0.018554688,-0.055755615,0.0065193176,0.037109375,-0.051361084,-0.0012989044,-0.0040779114,0.034606934,-0.03555298,-0.006462097,0.048858643,-0.040863037,0.015312195,0.012290955,-0.008392334,-0.01776123,4.2319298E-4,0.020858765,0.006591797,-0.024398804,0.055908203,-0.03451538,0.03491211,0.004634857,-0.022888184,-0.01576233,-0.0025596619,0.022369385,-0.08081055,-0.03543091,-0.022583008,0.042175293,-0.024002075,0.025268555,0.06689453,-0.003742218,9.098053E-4,-0.028427124,-0.031707764,-0.008720398,0.0045318604,-0.025741577,-0.007663727,-0.042175293,0.007980347,-0.050445557,0.035705566,0.021957397,0.018676758,0.05230713,-0.006954193,0.012290955,0.032714844,0.009635925,-0.0058631897,0.02734375,0.01626587,-0.0134887695,0.012817383,-0.0062675476,0.015716553,-0.0048713684,0.04119873,-0.03326416,-0.0051651,-0.004211426,-0.0440979,-0.014381409,0.004760742,-0.017349243,-0.03778076,0.00566864,0.0395813,-0.032348633,-0.012565613,-0.019058228,-0.028945923,0.01953125,-0.036499023,-0.022369385,0.007736206,0.0016527176,0.009216309,0.009170532,-0.051635742,-0.074523926,0.07147217,-0.050872803,-0.013763428,0.027648926,0.04534912,0.0368042,-0.03665161,-7.390976E-6,0.011962891,0.010444641,-0.04800415,-0.020339966,0.0184021,-0.007484436,0.006580353,-0.009216309,0.019470215,0.039978027,-0.0018348694,-0.010734558,0.023269653,-0.0368042,0.04159546,0.03729248,-0.010177612,0.0063705444,0.