2be00d86-4447-45c3-8989-44df2772ce82	2026-07-03 09:57:36.584445+00	2026-07-03 09:57:36.584445+00	66	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Gối Chữ U Thảo Dược NaHerbs** là sản phẩm hỗ trợ nâng đỡ vùng cổ và gáy, được thiết kế theo đường cong chữ U ôm sát cổ, giúp tạo cảm giác thoải mái khi nghỉ ngơi, làm việc hoặc di chuyển trên ô tô, máy bay và tàu xe.\n\nBên trong gối là **100% thảo dược thiên nhiên** kết hợp cùng lớp bông mềm mại, giúp gối vừa giữ được độ êm ái vừa lan tỏa hương thơm nhẹ nhàng, mang lại cảm giác thư giãn trong quá trình sử dụng.\n\nThiết kế dây buộc phía trước giúp cố định gối, hạn chế xê dịch khi ngồi hoặc ngủ. Lõi thảo dược có thể tháo rời để vệ sinh vỏ gối và thay mới khi cần, giúp sản phẩm luôn sạch sẽ và bền đẹp theo thời gian.\n\nSản phẩm có hai màu sắc **Be** và **Nâu**, phù hợp với nhiều phong cách và nhu cầu sử dụng.	[-0.018875122,0.035064697,-0.03302002,0.0057296753,0.025787354,-0.030136108,-0.03475952,0.043792725,0.037506104,-0.029586792,-0.03591919,-0.007850647,-0.048950195,-0.034484863,0.01322937,-0.005340576,-4.6634674E-4,-0.029922485,-0.023162842,0.009567261,0.0067253113,0.061523438,0.03604126,0.016098022,0.038085938,-0.016342163,0.035186768,0.016479492,-5.221367E-4,-0.026412964,-0.021484375,-0.026779175,0.074401855,-0.014984131,0.016616821,0.02355957,0.00667572,0.017044067,0.021057129,-0.035583496,0.0028419495,0.019485474,-0.0013227463,-0.02760315,-0.023284912,0.027999878,0.019210815,0.041625977,0.013442993,-0.009361267,0.033477783,-0.008865356,-0.030654907,0.046142578,-0.005706787,-0.00566864,-0.017547607,0.049987793,-0.0048828125,-0.026245117,-0.03274536,-0.06829834,0.0021629333,0.03817749,-0.06982422,0.0023727417,0.006034851,-0.024459839,-0.008338928,0.008110046,0.009223938,0.0072364807,-0.0107040405,0.036590576,0.0023784637,-0.012908936,-0.036590576,-0.01751709,0.033447266,-0.028762817,-0.033416748,-0.004611969,-0.021728516,0.019088745,-0.007446289,-0.041748047,-0.053894043,0.02218628,-0.07946777,0.016921997,0.0069732666,-0.009422302,0.053