72386ea4-6a50-43a2-931f-151b36f635e2	2026-07-03 09:55:48.957695+00	2026-07-03 09:55:48.957695+00	72	* Mất kiểm soát tiểu tiện hoặc đại tiện.\n\nĐây có thể là dấu hiệu của những vấn đề nghiêm trọng hơn và cần được thăm khám bởi bác sĩ.\n\n## **Câu hỏi thường gặp**\n\n### **Đau lưng có nên nằm nghỉ hoàn toàn không?**\n\nKhông. Nếu đau lưng do căng cơ hoặc ngồi sai tư thế, bạn vẫn nên vận động nhẹ nhàng và tránh nằm bất động trong thời gian dài.\n\n### **Chườm nóng có giúp giảm đau lưng không?**\n\nChườm ấm thường được nhiều người áp dụng để giúp thư giãn cơ và tạo cảm giác dễ chịu khi vùng lưng bị căng cứng. Tuy nhiên, cần sử dụng đúng nhiệt độ và thời gian phù hợp.\n\n### **Gối công thái học có hỗ trợ giảm đau lưng không?**	[-0.028808594,0.027770996,-0.025283813,0.016403198,0.0463562,-0.028778076,-0.027786255,-0.032714844,0.037597656,0.008857727,-0.05029297,0.05178833,-0.054870605,0.021453857,0.015625,0.014480591,-0.04324341,0.019729614,0.01727295,-0.015975952,0.005104065,0.038513184,0.01525116,-0.013313293,0.031585693,-0.047607422,0.02960205,0.022109985,0.0042381287,-0.02796936,0.038970947,-0.018432617,0.0146865845,-0.0045394897,-0.0054969788,0.09765625,-0.013015747,0.009307861,-0.008621216,-0.0927124,0.010971069,0.011276245,-0.023483276,-0.0067329407,-0.012084961,0.024871826,-0.028182983,-0.0047454834,0.02217102,0.0014572144,-0.021469116,-0.019683838,0.019546509,0.07745361,-4.6634674E-4,-0.028717041,-0.002149582,0.0035438538,0.082458496,-6.23703E-4,-0.015792847,0.0022182465,0.044891357,0.022140503,-0.055236816,-0.0042800903,0.028961182,-0.029266357,-0.022064209,-0.017303467,-0.027038574,0.0028133392,0.034240723,0.031982422,0.002855301,-0.0033226013,0.014709473,0.037963867,0.025665283,0.017486572,0.016342163,0.039276123,0.015579224,-0.009010315,-0.019958496,-0.050964355,-0.07946777,0.04083252,-0.02835083,-0.05255127,-0.02418518,0.06555176,0.042907715,0.009712219,0.038635254,-0.023254395,0.01914978,-0.030303955,-0.03074646,-0.014518738,-0.010307312,0.0039901733,0.025