11342563-2221-4007-bc8a-f51f6e769245	2026-07-03 09:55:54.822446+00	2026-07-03 09:55:54.822446+00	2	ệm sử dụng an toàn và đáng tin cậy.\r\n\r\nVới phương châm **"Giải pháp chăm sóc sức khỏe từ thiên nhiên"**, NaHerbs mong muốn giúp mỗi người chủ động chăm sóc sức khỏe ngay tại nhà thông qua những giải pháp đơn giản, dễ sử dụng và phù hợp với nhịp sống hiện đại.\r\n\r\nKhông chỉ phục vụ khách hàng cá nhân, NaHerbs còn cung cấp các giải pháp quà tặng sức khỏe dành cho doanh nghiệp, góp phần nâng cao phúc lợi nhân viên và lan tỏa sự quan tâm đến sức khỏe trong cộng đồng.\r\n\r\nNaHerbs tin rằng, sức khỏe bền vững bắt đầu từ những thói quen nhỏ mỗi ngày. Vì vậy, chúng tôi không ngừng nghiên cứu, cải tiến và phát triển các sản phẩm chất lượng, đồng hành cùng bạn trên hành trình chăm sóc bản thân và những người thân yêu.	[0.028884888,0.026367188,-0.015472412,0.026672363,0.09295654,-0.032073975,-0.040802002,0.06774902,0.010391235,-0.037994385,0.0020942688,-0.020904541,-0.03970337,-0.017913818,0.007507324,-0.0020713806,-0.045684814,-0.038726807,-0.025802612,-0.064086914,0.03945923,0.08392334,0.018234253,-0.020843506,0.008201599,-0.056152344,0.0178833,-0.0049476624,0.016220093,-0.06298828,0.012489319,-0.025161743,0.028045654,0.029159546,0.029083252,0.068603516,0.01109314,-0.00819397,0.008766174,-0.0052261353,-0.0037975311,0.012084961,0.01197052,0.03186035,0.004699707,-0.023529053,-0.029846191,-0.013031006,0.014381409,-0.008911133,0.009880066,-0.04034424,0.004962921,0.03100586,-0.017822266,-0.014228821,-0.011909485,0.058746338,-0.058410645,0.041625977,-0.0036449432,-0.041046143,-0.0029354095,0.045440674,-0.097839355,0.010910034,0.009315491,-0.04776001,-0.015701294,0.01184845,0.0075798035,-0.010375977,0.004180908,0.014411926,-0.033447266,-0.031280518,-0.015136719,0.03439331,0.02053833,-0.0038890839,-0.012260437,0.0060806274,0.0060157776,0.051727295,-0.031402588,-0.019577026,-0.013908386,0.0064315796,-0.07867432,0.021820068,0.014442444,0.043792725,0.044952393,-0.018829346,0.0630