754f4fdd-aa81-4b94-af7f-e22a232c662d	2026-07-03 09:55:54.822446+00	2026-07-03 09:55:54.822446+00	6	* Giá trị cốt lõi\r\n\r\n**Giá trị cốt lõi của NaHerbs được xây dựng dựa trên mô hình 4R:**\r\n\r\n**Responsibility (Trách nhiệm):** Chúng tôi cam kết mang đến những sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe từ thảo dược thiên nhiên an toàn, góp phần hỗ trợ người tiêu dùng xây dựng lối sống lành mạnh và nâng cao chất lượng cuộc sống.\r\n\r\n**Respectability (Tôn trọng):** Chúng tôi trân trọng giá trị của các loại thảo dược Việt Nam, ưu tiên nguồn nguyên liệu chất lượng, minh bạch về xuất xứ và phát triển bền vững cùng các đối tác.\r\n\r\n**Renovation (Đổi mới):** Chúng tôi không ngừng nghiên cứu và cải tiến sản phẩm, kết hợp thảo dược thiên nhiên với thiết kế hiện đại để mang đến trải nghiệm sử dụng tiện lợi, thoải mái và phù hợp với nhu cầu của người tiêu dùng.\r\n\r\n**Reliability (Đáng tin cậy):** Chúng tôi xây dựng niềm	[0.009887695,0.03213501,-0.020111084,0.024734497,0.061523438,-0.031341553,-0.042755127,0.03353882,0.011878967,-0.021652222,0.020996094,0.022781372,-0.043518066,-0.015037537,-0.015106201,-0.064086914,-0.045074463,-0.04837036,-0.02670288,-0.042999268,-0.012672424,0.033996582,0.012832642,-0.025848389,0.04345703,-0.034210205,0.0020713806,-0.0060653687,0.012214661,-0.045288086,-0.007007599,-0.02230835,0.06274414,0.02279663,0.022720337,0.018615723,0.029464722,-0.02571106,0.030410767,-0.011627197,-0.00390625,0.03363037,8.2826614E-4,0.028381348,0.017669678,-0.002576828,-0.036102295,-0.020431519,0.007972717,0.0019159317,0.009887695,-0.032989502,-0.0059928894,0.03363037,-0.018356323,-0.018585205,0.0027446747,0.047821045,-0.031982422,0.023605347,-0.01927185,-0.06640625,-0.010398865,0.016342163,-0.063964844,0.006729126,-0.022903442,-0.049438477,0.014823914,0.021347046,-0.017623901,0.016113281,-0.0093307495,0.03933716,-0.016082764,-0.011810303,-0.042999268,0.019638062,0.020080566,-0.05203247,-0.005809784,-0.0057258606,0.02911377,0.011795044,0.012191772,-0.03152466,-0.013839722