dc629538-1b33-4973-969a-b249cb459a7b	2026-07-03 09:56:03.760042+00	2026-07-03 09:56:03.760042+00	84	* Duy trì chế độ dinh dưỡng và nghỉ ngơi hợp lý.\n\nĐây là những giải pháp đơn giản, dễ thực hiện và có thể áp dụng trong sinh hoạt hằng ngày.\n\n## **Vì sao xu hướng giảm đau tự nhiên ngày càng phổ biến?**\n\nNhững năm gần đây, người tiêu dùng có xu hướng quan tâm nhiều hơn đến việc chăm sóc sức khỏe chủ động. Thay vì chỉ xử lý khi xuất hiện cơn đau, nhiều người lựa chọn các giải pháp giúp cơ thể thư giãn và hạn chế tình trạng đau mỏi trong cuộc sống hằng ngày.\n\nMột số lý do khiến **giảm đau tự nhiên** trở thành xu hướng gồm:	[0.007522583,0.033569336,-0.024002075,0.034576416,0.061706543,-0.025024414,0.002691269,0.029525757,0.040985107,0.01789856,-0.014862061,0.015701294,-0.019805908,0.008728027,0.008361816,0.008369446,0.020614624,-0.0021743774,0.02305603,-0.012962341,0.014678955,0.055603027,0.033325195,-0.025512695,0.0068244934,-0.015205383,0.00894165,0.002401352,-0.03463745,-0.07342529,-0.009475708,-0.014381409,0.0022087097,-0.03616333,0.026977539,0.040130615,-0.021820068,0.02494812,-0.03366089,-0.05227661,-0.022750854,-0.026016235,-0.004787445,-0.025390625,-0.0070343018,0.045196533,-0.04171753,0.004814148,0.03277588,0.021148682,-0.035491943,-0.030700684,0.043182373,0.047698975,-0.009849548,-9.880066E-4,-0.025238037,-0.021743774,0.0012950897,0.035247803,0.012916565,-0.01953125,0.022613525,0.062927246,-0.02192688,-0.0028934479,0.015136719,-0.055541992,-0.0025157928,0.026885986,0.001996994,-0.011917114,0.024414062,0.062683105,0.022628784,-0.04083252,-0.007820129,0.021224976,0.009025574,-0.0024433136,0.025131226,0.0030155182,-0.01751709,0.04840088,-0.04837036,-0.0680542,-0.026275635,0.055755615,-0.03048706,-0.020950317,0.0042877197,0.032318115,0.0040283203,-0.018539429,0.05496216,0.014709473,0.0075912476,0.022598267,-0.007736206,-0.005317688,0.035888672,-0.0463562,0.013923645,0.04660034,0.009468079,-0.048614502,-0.019424438,-0.0017576218,-0.045135498,0.019424438,0.03