e6729051-af04-4548-8644-23683fb65b72	2026-07-03 09:56:03.760961+00	2026-07-03 09:56:03.760961+00	89	* Mang lại cảm giác thư giãn cho cả cơ thể và tinh thần.\n\nChính vì vậy, nhiều sản phẩm ứng dụng thảo dược thiên nhiên đã được phát triển nhằm đáp ứng nhu cầu của người tiêu dùng hiện đại.\n\n## **Những loại thảo dược thường được sử dụng trong các sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe**\n\n### **Ngải cứu**\n\n(ảnh)\n\nNgải cứu là loại thảo dược quen thuộc trong đời sống người Việt. Với hương thơm đặc trưng, ngải cứu thường được sử dụng trong các sản phẩm như túi chườm, gối thảo dược hay các bài xông truyền thống nhằm mang lại cảm giác thư giãn.\n\n### **Gừng**\n\n(ảnh)\n\nGừng có mùi thơm ấm, thường xuất hiện trong nhiều sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe. Đây cũng là nguyên liệu được nhiều người lựa chọn khi chườm ấm hoặc kết hợp với các loại thảo dược khác.\n\n### **Sả**\n\n(ảnh)	[0.027496338,0.001127243,-0.06384277,0.021255493,0.040496826,-0.051208496,-0.05102539,0.05053711,0.024978638,-0.014122009,9.355545E-4,0.0036697388,-0.0050468445,-0.0035896301,0.017486572,-0.0025405884,-0.01663208,-0.011947632,-0.008018494,-5.1259995E-4,0.042663574,0.031982422,-0.004802704,0.010520935,0.005016327,-0.027420044,-0.010131836,0.031555176,0.011680603,-0.020843506,-0.014328003,-0.025543213,0.046569824,-0.023544312,0.042938232,0.04458618,-0.029251099,-0.003145218,0.008743286,-0.035308838,0.016189575,0.0018234253,-0.0027236938,0.014587402,0.020065308,-0.0057144165,-0.021026611,-0.03439331,-2.2029877E-4,-0.011352539,0.017822266,-0.054260254,0.0023174286,0.05831909,0.022216797,-2.2864342E-4,-0.021453857,0.022018433,0.004966736,-0.0010442734,-0.016677856,-0.029800415,-0.013648987,0.041778564,-0.050933838,0.009254456,0.014320374,-0.028549194,-0.039398193,-0.0077781677,3.1542778E-4,-0.027267456,0.006401062,0.035247803,-0.009979248,-0.009468079,-0.01876831,-0.0070648193,0.030685425,-0.04510498,0.013031006,0.022323608,-0.01020813,0.001326561,-0.01309967,-0.036987305,-0.014221191,0.083740234,-0.034362793,0.0