fb54959f-1a56-4d10-88fc-68416c5cc11e	2026-07-03 09:56:03.761126+00	2026-07-03 09:56:03.761126+00	90	cũng là nguyên liệu được nhiều người lựa chọn khi chườm ấm hoặc kết hợp với các loại thảo dược khác.\n\n### **Sả**\n\n(ảnh)\n\nSả mang hương thơm tươi mát, giúp không gian trở nên dễ chịu hơn. Tinh dầu sả cũng được nhiều người sử dụng trong quá trình thư giãn sau một ngày làm việc.\n\n### **Quế**\n\n(ảnh)\n\nQuế có mùi thơm nồng ấm, thường được kết hợp với gừng hoặc ngải cứu trong các sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe từ thiên nhiên.\n\n### **Lá đinh lăng và hạt muồng**\n\n(ảnh)\n\nĐây là hai nguyên liệu quen thuộc trong nhiều sản phẩm hỗ trợ thư giãn và chăm sóc sức khỏe, đặc biệt là các sản phẩm hướng đến việc nâng cao chất lượng nghỉ ngơi.\n\n## **Các phương pháp giảm đau tự nhiên được nhiều người lựa chọn**	[0.004135132,0.005706787,-0.015304565,0.0069503784,0.095336914,-0.05670166,-0.022628784,0.031341553,0.021072388,-0.015357971,-0.020111084,0.009056091,-0.008407593,0.020584106,-0.007675171,0.032440186,0.021621704,5.788803E-4,0.012763977,-0.028213501,0.010917664,0.046417236,-0.006374359,0.044952393,0.017410278,-0.025726318,-0.010726929,0.02180481,0.0013628006,-0.04864502,-0.01133728,-0.03274536,0.016052246,-0.025100708,0.011276245,0.05795288,-0.0070228577,0.018127441,-0.037261963,-0.048858643,-0.015388489,0.023910522,-0.004295349,-0.003025055,0.0141067505,-8.840561E-4,-0.038909912,0.0053215027,0.02468872,-0.002122879,-0.023117065,-0.035980225,0.033111572,0.02154541,0.020095825,-0.004135132,-0.034057617,0.018676758,0.018127441,-0.0034122467,-0.011604309,0.013793945,0.0022068024,0.05126953,-0.055145264,-0.03060913,0.00762558,-0.035217285,-0.0423584,0.03060913,-0.005622864,-0.012916565,0.02420044,0.034484863,-0.007835388,-0.035186768,-0.034057617,-0.010398865,0.037841797,-0.0256958,-0.004924774,0.015487671,-0.01802063,0.0036296844,-0.022537231,-0.055603027,-0.02696228,0.07873535,-0.052825928,0.009750366,-0.007926941,0.026184082,0.043884277,-0.049682617,0.04220581,0.0314941