907e3c62-a871-4443-8056-5ba724d516fa	2026-07-03 09:56:03.761466+00	2026-07-03 09:56:03.761466+00	92	kéo giãn cơ giúp duy trì sự linh hoạt của cơ thể và giảm tình trạng căng cứng sau nhiều giờ làm việc.\n\n### **Chườm ấm**\n\nNhiệt độ ấm giúp các nhóm cơ được thư giãn, đặc biệt sau khi vận động hoặc làm việc trong thời gian dài. Nhiều người lựa chọn túi chườm thảo dược như một phương pháp chăm sóc tại nhà.\n\n### **Massage thư giãn**\n\nMassage nhẹ nhàng giúp cơ thể được thả lỏng sau một ngày làm việc. Bạn có thể kết hợp cùng tinh dầu thiên nhiên để tăng cảm giác thư giãn.\n\n### **Sử dụng sản phẩm từ thảo dược**\n\nĐây là lựa chọn ngày càng phổ biến đối với những người theo đuổi lối sống lành mạnh.\n\nMột số sản phẩm được nhiều người lựa chọn gồm:	[0.005130768,0.014472961,-0.0060806274,0.028381348,0.042633057,-0.02897644,-0.04336548,0.046661377,0.028411865,-0.003660202,-0.01776123,0.0143585205,-0.048614502,0.010108948,0.020355225,-0.009399414,-0.004383087,-0.0095825195,0.0113220215,-1.4841557E-4,0.01928711,0.05532837,-0.026565552,-0.030029297,0.017547607,-0.01626587,-0.010757446,0.030319214,-0.0058288574,-0.06958008,0.007881165,-0.01889038,0.024276733,-0.0135650635,0.03866577,0.027130127,0.0044174194,0.0093307495,-1.5926361E-4,-0.047332764,0.016799927,0.0039711,-0.0074920654,0.016921997,-0.029434204,-0.00712204,-0.015014648,-0.005672455,0.043701172,0.021026611,0.01625061,-0.029891968,0.0075263977,0.04989624,0.035705566,-0.012161255,-0.015563965,0.0010185242,0.0041275024,0.00844574,0.010322571,-0.011360168,0.031463623,0.041137695,-0.07696533,0.008369446,-0.0067749023,-0.046905518,-0.030380249,-0.013710022,-0.032226562,-0.017486572,0.024459839,0.042114258,0.0045700073,-0.03274536,-0.027297974,-0.02027893,0.029144287,0.009712219,0.019363403,-0.024337769,0.0026474,0.03933716,-0.028213501,-0.08654785,-0.023925781,0.056488037,-0.045837402,0.001663208,-0.0016956329,0.010559082,0.022720337,-0.0146102905,0.021850586,0.014839172,0.0112838745,-0.056732178,-0.005393982,0.006515