3a9e8543-6395-4e22-80c7-9b6330f0b50f	2026-07-03 09:56:18.2104+00	2026-07-03 09:56:18.2104+00	112	# **Đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy: Nguyên nhân và cách khắc phục**\n\nBạn thức dậy sau một đêm nghỉ ngơi nhưng lại cảm thấy cổ cứng, vai đau nhức hoặc khó xoay đầu? Đây là tình trạng khá phổ biến và có thể xảy ra ở nhiều đối tượng, từ nhân viên văn phòng, người lớn tuổi cho đến những người thường xuyên sử dụng điện thoại hoặc máy tính.\n\nTrong hầu hết các trường hợp, **đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy** xuất phát từ thói quen sinh hoạt hoặc tư thế ngủ chưa phù hợp. Tuy nhiên, nếu tình trạng này kéo dài hoặc xuất hiện thường xuyên, đây cũng có thể là dấu hiệu cảnh báo các vấn đề liên quan đến cơ xương khớp.\n\nTrong bài viết dưới đây, NaHerbs sẽ giúp bạn hiểu rõ nguyên nhân, cách khắc phục cũng như những phương pháp phòng ngừa hiệu quả.\n\n## **Vì sao bạn bị đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy?**	[-0.035858154,0.049621582,-0.03753662,-0.005844116,0.019180298,-0.032592773,0.029205322,-0.0077209473,0.049316406,-0.0082092285,-0.016693115,0.029403687,-0.02796936,-0.011581421,0.014099121,0.025558472,0.018508911,-0.0044021606,0.0076560974,-0.020736694,0.001821518,0.07104492,0.03503418,-0.027053833,0.03527832,-0.020889282,0.035095215,0.005420685,-0.0030765533,-0.020904541,-0.050750732,-0.016159058,0.0079574585,-0.04421997,0.0062789917,0.06274414,0.0075531006,0.017700195,-0.03488159,-0.08129883,0.01473999,0.009544373,0.009300232,-0.04272461,-0.051727295,5.707741E-4,-0.02168274,0.0069847107,0.005695343,0.029693604,-0.035247803,-0.013664246,0.026687622,0.051208496,0.0062408447,-0.045562744,-0.016998291,0.036865234,0.022033691,0.0037822723,-0.006919861,0.008575439,0.0149002075,0.029006958,-0.015625,-0.024139404,0.032348633,-0.026504517,0.0053863525,0.02758789,-0.02053833,0.036468506,0.024627686,0.058410645,0.012825012,-0.042663574,-0.025512695,0.02027893,0.022018433,-0.016113281,-0.003774643,-0.028900146,-0.017700195,0.01939392,-0.024749756,-0.049041748,-0.07092285,0.018127441,-0.034973145,0.0204