4c571d9a-c0a8-4f53-8e12-e097a10154d5	2026-07-03 09:56:18.210595+00	2026-07-03 09:56:18.210595+00	113	nhân, cách khắc phục cũng như những phương pháp phòng ngừa hiệu quả.\n\n## **Vì sao bạn bị đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy?**\n\nCó nhiều nguyên nhân dẫn đến **đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy**, trong đó phần lớn liên quan đến tư thế ngủ và thói quen sinh hoạt.\n\n### **Ngủ sai tư thế**\n\nĐây là nguyên nhân phổ biến nhất. Khi ngủ nằm sấp, nằm nghiêng quá lâu hoặc xoay cổ ở một góc không tự nhiên, các nhóm cơ vùng cổ và vai phải chịu áp lực trong nhiều giờ liên tục.\n\nSau khi thức dậy, bạn có thể gặp các triệu chứng như:	[-0.037078857,0.046325684,-0.025054932,-0.0032787323,0.015052795,-0.05807495,0.023254395,-0.046081543,0.052368164,-0.007896423,-0.0099487305,0.043762207,-0.05014038,-0.020019531,0.019943237,0.028305054,0.0463562,-0.02218628,0.010116577,-0.021728516,0.009033203,0.048675537,0.031951904,-0.044006348,0.019042969,-0.006877899,0.02796936,-0.014694214,-0.046905518,-0.023803711,-0.014732361,-0.008453369,0.019729614,-0.043151855,-3.6764145E-4,0.05722046,-0.0047302246,0.003818512,-0.015594482,-0.070129395,0.021911621,-0.014404297,-0.0067710876,-0.056549072,-0.024230957,0.060150146,-0.016342163,0.013259888,-0.010040283,0.0423584,-0.029220581,-0.020492554,0.036987305,0.049438477,0.010696411,-0.008621216,0.003917694,0.01436615,0.008277893,0.011230469,-0.011451721,0.042419434,-0.0093307495,0.050567627,0.010917664,-0.044525146,-0.007003784,-0.03074646,-0.016906738,-0.0028858185,-0.034973145,0.028762817,0.006549835,0.06768799,0.026229858,-0.035827637,-0.0042533875,0.013809204,0.04284668,0.008377075,-0.0256958,-0.02558899,-0.0076179504,0.02041626,-0.042633057,-0.04208374,-0.070007324,0.028381348,-0.0019245148,-0.002166748,-0.020843506,0.05380249,0.017913818,-0.013916016,-0.04611206,0.0048103333,0.03643799,-0.041656494,-0.008178711,-0.01209259,0.03564453,-0.023254395,0.025772095,0.05429077,-0.007297516,-0.058929443,-0.03439331,0.009170532,-0.0259552,0.012390137,0.074401855,-