6b919a3e-daad-4d44-8e0f-ef721ce3249e	2026-07-03 09:56:18.21116+00	2026-07-03 09:56:18.21116+00	117	* Cảm giác căng cơ vùng cổ.\n\n(ảnh)\n\n### **Gối ngủ không phù hợp**\n\nChiếc gối quá cao hoặc quá thấp đều có thể khiến cột sống cổ không được nâng đỡ đúng cách.\n\nMột chiếc gối không phù hợp sẽ khiến vùng cổ bị gập hoặc ngửa quá mức trong suốt thời gian ngủ, làm tăng nguy cơ **đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy**.\n\nHiện nay, nhiều người lựa chọn **gối công thái học thảo dược** nhờ thiết kế ôm sát đường cong tự nhiên của cổ, giúp nâng đỡ đầu và vai tốt hơn trong khi ngủ.\n\n### **Đệm quá cứng hoặc quá mềm**\n\nĐệm không phù hợp cũng ảnh hưởng đến tư thế ngủ.\n\nNếu đệm quá mềm, cơ thể sẽ bị lún khiến cột sống cong bất thường. Ngược lại, đệm quá cứng có thể tạo áp lực lên vùng vai và lưng, gây cảm giác đau mỏi sau khi thức dậy.\n\n### **Làm việc sai tư thế trước khi ngủ**	[0.0073928833,0.03213501,-0.05227661,0.016067505,0.02444458,-0.0181427,-0.0019235611,-0.04360962,0.032470703,-0.032073975,-0.028427124,0.037078857,-0.036346436,0.0390625,-0.007537842,0.00434494,0.027679443,-0.016174316,0.029449463,-0.008110046,0.008132935,0.035583496,0.010848999,-0.008705139,-0.005897522,0.020141602,0.085876465,0.008613586,-0.0031166077,-0.019989014,-0.015960693,-0.021697998,0.040893555,-0.09020996,0.0059394836,0.058563232,0.007457733,0.01600647,1.9061565E-4,-0.049041748,-0.005756378,0.035491943,0.013183594,-0.010238647,-0.037261963,0.004764557,-0.0143585205,-0.01322937,0.015991211,0.036254883,-0.0044555664,0.0079193115,0.027008057,0.049743652,0.011688232,-0.018707275,-0.004497528,0.0030651093,0.019378662,0.024993896,-0.025436401,-0.023376465,0.009140015,0.047424316,-0.027908325,-0.030273438,0.028442383,-0.061157227,-0.022521973,0.010887146,-0.039978027,0.027801514,0.015510559,0.050720215,0.016571045,-0.020462036,-0.003314972,0.005130768,0.012229919,-0.00121212,-0.0063591003,0.002210617,0.01360321,0.0044059753,-0.04208374,-0.040618896,-0.09375,0.05102539,-0.009132385,-0.0046463013,-0.007