cbdcf766-e1ff-4064-90c8-50c121682f34	2026-07-03 09:56:18.211301+00	2026-07-03 09:56:18.211301+00	118	ó thể tạo áp lực lên vùng vai và lưng, gây cảm giác đau mỏi sau khi thức dậy.\n\n### **Làm việc sai tư thế trước khi ngủ**\n\nNgồi làm việc nhiều giờ, cúi đầu sử dụng điện thoại hoặc mang vác vật nặng trước khi đi ngủ khiến các nhóm cơ vùng cổ và vai chưa kịp thư giãn.\n\nĐây cũng là nguyên nhân khiến nhiều người bị **đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy** mặc dù thời gian ngủ vẫn đủ.\n\n(ảnh)\n\n### **Căng thẳng kéo dài**\n\nStress khiến cơ bắp luôn trong trạng thái co cứng, đặc biệt là vùng cổ và vai.\n\nNếu tình trạng này kéo dài, bạn có thể thức dậy với cảm giác đau mỏi dù không hề vận động mạnh.\n\n## **Dấu hiệu thường gặp khi đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy**\n\nTùy từng nguyên nhân, triệu chứng có thể khác nhau. Một số biểu hiện phổ biến gồm:	[-0.0057754517,0.030929565,-0.040924072,-0.012542725,-0.01348114,-0.04284668,0.01902771,-0.03262329,0.027755737,-0.020217896,-0.037628174,0.053497314,-0.018493652,0.0048294067,-0.009552002,0.0014486313,0.02909851,-0.0119018555,-4.5347214E-4,-0.03552246,0.010375977,0.036590576,0.009986877,-0.026168823,-0.0045700073,-0.0038433075,0.03326416,-0.0023097992,-0.017501831,-0.010253906,-0.033935547,-0.024963379,0.025878906,-0.019424438,1.8584728E-4,0.068481445,-0.011688232,0.0046195984,0.012542725,-0.0736084,0.020309448,0.02319336,-0.021224976,-0.008781433,-0.03125,0.010643005,-0.0087890625,0.019165039,0.020965576,0.046417236,0.010101318,-0.0060310364,0.059753418,0.043029785,0.013725281,-0.021224976,-0.0025482178,0.0038433075,0.048339844,0.023147583,0.024032593,0.0061073303,0.022232056,0.019989014,-0.015930176,-0.02027893,0.003534317,-0.027664185,0.007419586,0.011444092,-0.036621094,0.021057129,0.03881836,0.06274414,0.035827637,-0.048553467,-0.0024280548,0.004753113,0.01928711,-0.021652222,-0.010475159,-0.025177002,0.019592285,-0.0017194748,-0.051330566,-0.019180298,-0.07525635,0.006286621,-3.3712387E-4,0.0066184998,-0.033172607,0.055847168,0