8f2ea4de-afb8-4168-b042-2e7586e6b0ab	2026-07-03 09:56:33.952991+00	2026-07-03 09:56:33.952991+00	128	* Không gập cổ quá nhiều khi ngủ.\n\nMột tư thế ngủ đúng sẽ giúp giảm áp lực lên vùng cổ vai gáy trong suốt đêm.\n\n### **Sử dụng gối công thái học**\n\nMột chiếc **gối công thái học thảo dược** có thiết kế phù hợp sẽ giúp nâng đỡ đầu, cổ và vai theo đường cong tự nhiên của cơ thể.\n\nNgoài khả năng nâng đỡ, hương thơm từ các loại thảo dược như ngải cứu, gừng, sả hay quế còn giúp tạo cảm giác thư giãn trước khi ngủ, góp phần nâng cao chất lượng nghỉ ngơi.\n\n### **Chườm ấm vùng cổ vai gáy**\n\nNếu vùng cổ bị căng cứng, bạn có thể chườm ấm khoảng 15–20 phút.\n\nCó thể sử dụng:	[-0.007095337,0.027069092,-0.043884277,0.006641388,-0.016067505,-0.043823242,-0.009674072,-0.023544312,0.043792725,-0.015731812,-0.02999878,0.052459717,-0.03010559,0.007160187,0.0030403137,0.0047302246,-0.011428833,0.018081665,0.012458801,-2.4580956E-4,-0.017944336,0.03567505,0.016098022,-0.008338928,0.027420044,0.009483337,0.049682617,-0.009300232,-0.017303467,-0.033477783,-0.0017595291,-0.029769897,0.01914978,-0.060821533,0.0011997223,0.06137085,-0.010345459,0.016571045,-0.015136719,-0.03869629,0.0045547485,0.018508911,-0.008308411,-0.03427124,-0.030151367,0.005672455,-0.018981934,0.022323608,0.005722046,0.013801575,-0.02178955,-0.0073127747,0.026306152,0.043823242,0.011619568,-0.025772095,5.297661E-4,0.031982422,0.019729614,0.022979736,-0.019439697,-0.02331543,0.025131226,0.02482605,-0.034362793,-7.829666E-4,0.00844574,-0.022750854,0.0018873215,0.01914978,-0.046936035,0.030853271,0.039367676,0.01838684,-0.01689148,-0.03805542,-0.008651733,0.012237549,0.006690979,-0.0028743744,-0.025634766,0.0013895035,0.013336182,0.015098572,-0.023391724,-0.064453125,-0.093322754,0.08276367,-0.021194458,0.017715454,0.0054779053,0.014572144,0.019989014,0.0051498413,-0.007736206,8.72612E-4,0.049865723,-0.050048828,-0.005420685,0.017578125,0.056365967,-0.0015878677,-0.0072288513,0.03982544,0.036590576,0.00137901