b72dda9c-db50-4630-bc9f-62f7a038c489	2026-07-03 09:56:49.352159+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.352159+00	151	* Kèm theo sốt hoặc sưng đỏ.\n\nViệc thăm khám sớm sẽ giúp xác định nguyên nhân và có hướng điều trị phù hợp.\n\n## **Câu hỏi thường gặp**\n\n### **Đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy có nguy hiểm không?**\n\nTrong nhiều trường hợp, tình trạng này chỉ xuất hiện do ngủ sai tư thế hoặc sử dụng gối không phù hợp. Tuy nhiên, nếu đau kéo dài hoặc đi kèm các triệu chứng bất thường, bạn nên đi khám để được kiểm tra.\n\n### **Gối công thái học có giúp giảm đau vai gáy không?**\n\nGối công thái học được thiết kế để nâng đỡ vùng đầu, cổ và vai theo tư thế tự nhiên. Khi lựa chọn đúng kích thước và độ cao phù hợp, sản phẩm có thể góp phần cải thiện tư thế ngủ và giảm áp lực lên vùng cổ vai gáy.\n\n### **Chườm nóng có giúp giảm đau vai gáy không?**	[-0.022567749,0.031311035,-0.012779236,9.651184E-4,-0.004306793,-0.059051514,-0.015777588,-0.033843994,0.04144287,-0.013656616,-0.051513672,0.037994385,-0.07141113,0.013343811,-0.0020370483,0.0138549805,0.0029277802,-0.0034275055,0.01411438,0.014030457,-0.0068359375,0.04736328,0.03225708,-0.030776978,0.027938843,-0.006855011,0.01739502,-0.018737793,-0.012168884,-0.023513794,0.0026054382,-0.011619568,-0.0075035095,-0.05456543,-0.013870239,0.062164307,-0.008903503,0.030090332,-0.022079468,-0.07434082,0.039093018,0.02557373,-0.035614014,-0.012336731,-0.021697998,0.018096924,-0.016723633,-0.013847351,-0.004436493,0.03366089,0.007583618,0.012359619,0.04699707,0.03805542,0.004348755,-0.024276733,9.226799E-4,0.0063591003,0.03765869,-0.007881165,0.0031814575,0.0062446594,0.027938843,0.023834229,-0.031280518,-0.0154418945,-0.0019950867,-0.019470215,0.019882202,-0.012634277,-0.038757324,0.04269409,0.041503906,0.03591919,0.020935059,-0.026382446,0.013328552,0.020645142,0.0028018951,0.014175415,-0.008369446,0.02822876,0.008140564,0.0042800903,-0.023086548,-0.059448242,-0.064941406,0.0670166,-0.040985107,-0.0029335022,-0.024047852,0.034454346,0.037719727,-