5b8ae939-33d1-4c8a-8318-c100000e0996	2026-07-03 09:56:49.352429+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.352429+00	152	hể góp phần cải thiện tư thế ngủ và giảm áp lực lên vùng cổ vai gáy.\n\n### **Chườm nóng có giúp giảm đau vai gáy không?**\n\nChườm ấm là phương pháp được nhiều người áp dụng khi vùng cổ vai gáy bị căng cứng. Tuy nhiên, cần sử dụng đúng nhiệt độ và thời gian, đồng thời không chườm lên vùng da bị tổn thương.\n\n## **Kết luận**\n\n**Đau vai gáy sau khi ngủ dậy** là tình trạng khá phổ biến và thường liên quan đến tư thế ngủ, gối không phù hợp hoặc thói quen sinh hoạt chưa khoa học. Việc điều chỉnh tư thế ngủ, lựa chọn **gối công thái học thảo dược**, kết hợp chườm ấm, tập kéo giãn và duy trì lối sống lành mạnh sẽ góp phần cải thiện cảm giác đau mỏi và nâng cao chất lượng giấc ngủ.	[-0.0019626617,0.022537231,-0.041259766,0.018173218,0.030151367,-0.0345459,0.039123535,-0.023498535,0.06689453,-0.014282227,-0.046142578,0.059326172,-0.05609131,0.038909912,0.013290405,0.004486084,0.016799927,-0.003955841,0.038238525,0.028213501,-0.026779175,0.032440186,0.024093628,-0.017456055,0.024307251,0.03744507,0.018478394,-0.013900757,-2.105236E-4,-0.013420105,-0.023925781,-0.015205383,0.020874023,-0.02760315,-0.0236969,0.048431396,-0.022598267,0.011314392,-0.016586304,-0.07574463,0.030029297,-0.017150879,-0.02684021,-0.023895264,-0.042755127,0.016693115,-0.010650635,-0.0073623657,0.033569336,0.033294678,-0.017288208,0.014556885,0.05645752,0.005657196,0.014816284,0.007575989,0.0037631989,0.018249512,0.0035209656,-0.0013360977,-0.020095825,8.273125E-5,0.024551392,0.020217896,-0.014839172,-0.019256592,0.005706787,-0.031158447,-0.0075950623,-0.017501831,-0.032440186,0.023452759,0.042053223,0.03805542,3.8433075E-4,-0.012046814,0.013763428,-0.012626648,0.023513794,0.02810669,-0.044708252,0.03387451,2.3841858E-4,-0.010498047,-0.022583008,-0.041992188,-0.07312012,0.07940674,-0.025741577,0.014259338,-0.014144897,0.053222656,0.014854431,0.0093688965,0.0052604675,0.0072364807,0.02671814,-0.041442