49a9aa1b-5a98-4709-a273-45b3f67655e8	2026-07-03 09:56:49.353415+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.353415+00	157	trong các sản phẩm hỗ trợ chăm sóc sức khỏe? Hãy cùng NaHerbs tìm hiểu trong bài viết dưới đây.\n\n## **Ngải cứu là gì?**\n\nNgải cứu (Artemisia vulgaris) là loại cây thân thảo có mùi thơm đặc trưng, thường mọc ở nhiều vùng khí hậu ôn đới và nhiệt đới. Tại Việt Nam, ngải cứu được trồng khá phổ biến và được sử dụng trong cả ẩm thực lẫn các phương pháp chăm sóc sức khỏe truyền thống.\n\nLá ngải cứu chứa nhiều tinh dầu tự nhiên tạo nên mùi thơm dễ chịu. Chính vì vậy, loại thảo dược này thường được sử dụng trong:	[0.017074585,0.01763916,-0.0049743652,-7.2288513E-4,0.053588867,-0.041107178,-0.036102295,0.073791504,0.018005371,-0.028411865,-0.019317627,0.017974854,-0.04611206,0.008140564,0.0022697449,-0.007041931,-0.009552002,0.015655518,-0.0070381165,0.01374054,0.020431519,0.061645508,0.022338867,0.011482239,0.018676758,-0.03555298,-0.028701782,0.023284912,-0.018661499,-0.019989014,-0.008255005,-0.023651123,0.015449524,0.020996094,0.028579712,0.02079773,-0.0072250366,0.0105896,0.020065308,-0.016571045,0.015945435,0.03201294,-0.0025367737,0.03451538,-0.008674622,0.0024414062,-0.021316528,-0.021759033,-2.6643276E-5,-0.028030396,0.026046753,-0.034729004,-0.0146865845,0.049713135,0.028167725,0.025665283,-0.025939941,0.050628662,-0.027954102,-0.010017395,-0.04815674,-0.05130005,0.0024375916,0.008018494,-0.06555176,0.01663208,-0.012008667,-0.057281494,-0.023452759,-0.0340271,0.0050811768,-0.0043792725,0.04144287,6.5279007E-4,-0.011367798,-0.004245758,-0.06945801,0.0055885315,0.035736084,-0.03817749,-0.00806427,0.030792236,2.5701523E-4,0.025390625,0.032836914,-0.044952393,-0.014633179,0.084228516,-0.06072998,0.009590149,0.0068359375,0.014709473,0.02923584,-0.036376953,0.032714844,-0.016433716,-0.014457703,-0.07318115,-0.035583496,0.016174316,0.009811401,-0.006664276,-6.3467026E-4,0.028182983,0.02268982,-0.059448242,0.020477295,0.04812622,-0.03817749,0.014129639,0.050048828,-0.00