046a6473-5333-4c41-afd1-d9dd1815a241	2026-07-03 09:56:49.354007+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.354007+00	161	* Tinh dầu hoặc sản phẩm tạo hương.\n\n## **Vì sao ngải cứu được sử dụng trong các sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe?**\n\nTừ lâu, ngải cứu đã được nhiều người lựa chọn nhờ hương thơm đặc trưng và cảm giác dễ chịu mà loại thảo dược này mang lại.\n\nNgày nay, ngải cứu thường được kết hợp với các nguyên liệu như gừng, quế, sả hoặc lá đinh lăng để tạo nên các sản phẩm hỗ trợ chăm sóc sức khỏe tại nhà. Đây cũng là lý do từ khóa **ngải cứu giảm đau** được nhiều người tìm kiếm khi muốn lựa chọn các sản phẩm có nguồn gốc từ thiên nhiên.\n\n## **Ngải cứu có tác dụng gì trong hỗ trợ giảm đau và thư giãn?**\n\n### **Mang lại cảm giác thư giãn cho cơ thể**	[0.003501892,0.011642456,-0.027282715,0.025436401,0.06414795,-0.050872803,-0.05529785,0.058135986,-0.0029449463,-0.0110321045,0.002023697,0.014083862,-0.04486084,-0.0024795532,0.021850586,0.028305054,0.00422287,-0.013092041,0.0017442703,-0.014282227,0.0074386597,0.04107666,0.011459351,0.0073776245,0.023010254,-0.051513672,0.0010213852,0.04107666,0.006767273,-0.040405273,-0.023132324,-0.029632568,0.037902832,0.02003479,0.01739502,0.050109863,-0.0026664734,-0.0054397583,-0.019195557,-0.051635742,3.244877E-4,-0.002773285,0.017059326,0.023712158,-0.005596161,0.009567261,-0.023666382,-0.028808594,-0.008354187,-0.0039043427,0.028289795,-0.01638794,-0.0015974045,0.027740479,0.028244019,0.020126343,-0.019500732,0.012535095,-0.00137043,-0.019760132,-0.029144287,-0.009407043,-0.01184082,0.020187378,-0.048095703,-0.001991272,-0.024124146,-0.038238525,-0.0071487427,-0.026992798,-0.013290405,-0.013824463,0.022018433,0.039123535,-0.006931305,-0.008178711,-0.02178955,0.033813477,0.026229858,-0.0395813,-0.01940918,0.056854248,-0.033447266,0.012649536,0.024337769,-0.061401367,-0.011291504,0.09112549,-0.057647705,-0.0052986145,-0.016983032,0.058441162,0.006576538,-0.025344849,0.03164673,0.008468628,0.012420654,-0.022338867,-0.015266418,0.038482666,0.