4b403290-738b-4903-87c4-5d1e9ee178d6	2026-07-03 09:56:49.354283+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.354283+00	163	phương pháp chăm sóc truyền thống, ngải cứu thường được sử dụng kết hợp với nhiệt để chườm lên các vùng cơ bị căng cứng.\n\nHiện nay, nhiều sản phẩm như túi chườm thảo dược chứa ngải cứu được thiết kế để mang lại cảm giác ấm áp và dễ chịu khi sử dụng. Đây cũng là lý do nhiều người quan tâm đến các sản phẩm **ngải cứu giảm đau** trong chăm sóc cơ thể tại nhà.\n\n### **Góp phần nâng cao chất lượng nghỉ ngơi**\n\nMột không gian nghỉ ngơi thoải mái có thể giúp cơ thể thư giãn tốt hơn. Mùi thơm dịu nhẹ từ ngải cứu thường được nhiều người yêu thích vì không quá nồng và tạo cảm giác gần gũi với thiên nhiên.\n\nĐó cũng là lý do ngải cứu được sử dụng trong các dòng **gối công thái học thảo dược**, giúp người dùng có trải nghiệm nghỉ ngơi dễ chịu hơn.\n\n### **Kết hợp tốt với nhiều loại thảo dược khác**	[0.01461792,0.014656067,-0.02229309,0.03286743,0.057495117,-0.02279663,-0.023910522,0.036193848,0.012588501,-0.023880005,-0.035308838,0.016403198,-0.041656494,0.029342651,0.010299683,-0.0035552979,-0.0138549805,-0.024032593,0.009063721,0.003068924,0.01309967,0.066467285,0.023590088,-0.014945984,0.035614014,-0.048614502,-0.013038635,0.06573486,0.00415802,-0.009048462,0.0037441254,-0.028457642,0.048736572,-0.0010166168,0.036315918,0.044525146,-0.0029029846,0.012954712,-0.005458832,-0.05126953,0.052978516,-0.020629883,-0.023406982,0.003572464,-0.012504578,0.032440186,0.0077705383,-0.0061912537,0.027862549,0.013771057,0.021270752,-0.023117065,-0.006958008,0.043151855,0.022445679,-5.903244E-4,0.0035858154,0.024246216,-1.7821789E-4,-0.038238525,-0.014450073,-0.02279663,0.029144287,0.03741455,-0.062805176,0.019134521,0.005355835,-0.058532715,-0.03918457,-0.028701782,0.014266968,-0.02180481,0.008514404,0.027679443,-2.2518635E-4,-0.009895325,-0.038909912,0.028518677,0.04425049,-0.024627686,0.022918701,0.004550934,-0.008895874,0.014221191,0.0053482056,-0.040527344,-0.023529053,0.07312012