a62a3afc-6dd1-4e72-b62e-00dd2e1c7be2	2026-07-03 09:56:49.355152+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.355152+00	169	* Hạt muồng.\n\nSự kết hợp này giúp các sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe từ thiên nhiên trở nên phong phú và phù hợp với nhiều nhu cầu sử dụng khác nhau.\n\n## **Những sản phẩm ứng dụng ngải cứu phổ biến hiện nay**\n\nNhờ đặc tính hương thơm tự nhiên, ngải cứu được ứng dụng trong nhiều sản phẩm chăm sóc sức khỏe.\n\n### **(ảnh)**\n\n### **Gối công thái học thảo dược**\n\nGối công thái học thảo dược kết hợp thiết kế nâng đỡ vùng đầu, cổ và vai cùng túi thảo dược chứa ngải cứu và các nguyên liệu thiên nhiên khác. Đây là sản phẩm được nhiều người lựa chọn để nâng cao trải nghiệm nghỉ ngơi.\n\n### **Túi chườm thảo dược**\n\nTúi chườm chứa ngải cứu thường được sử dụng kết hợp với nhiệt nhằm tạo cảm giác thư giãn cho các vùng cơ sau khi làm việc hoặc vận động.\n\n### **Đấm lưng thảo dược**	[0.020431519,-0.012306213,-0.020629883,0.02482605,0.056549072,-0.056549072,-0.044403076,0.064697266,0.02911377,-0.051086426,-0.015602112,-1.4066696E-4,-0.034576416,0.011810303,-0.0077323914,0.004989624,-0.038970947,-0.016403198,-0.013267517,-0.00869751,-0.011886597,0.027801514,0.018966675,0.012039185,0.007419586,-0.026947021,0.0019931793,0.020431519,-0.021606445,0.017288208,0.01309967,-0.03100586,0.048706055,0.0024662018,0.0069999695,0.04534912,-0.014930725,0.046051025,0.0060424805,-0.020904541,0.012252808,-0.0014705658,-0.0067710876,-0.018493652,-0.0070877075,0.0069274902,-6.1273575E-4,-0.030517578,0.004299164,0.015777588,0.023666382,-0.032043457,-0.005607605,0.034851074,0.013961792,-0.01007843,-0.029449463,0.019470215,-0.023208618,-0.014434814,-0.05053711,-0.020858765,0.013763428,0.018447876,-0.056884766,-0.015640259,-0.013267517,-0.050964355,-0.036834717,-0.012367249,0.015731812,-0.010971069,-0.011749268,0.038970947,0.0019626617,-0.018005371,-0.06793213,0.013328552,0.015808105,-0.00894928,0.0012159348,0.0231781,-1.8000603E-5,0.006198883,-0.0022602081,-0.04724121,-0.025344849,0.06414795,-0.0