187f995a-12fd-489e-82a1-6335ff10bf2c	2026-07-03 09:56:49.355312+00	2026-07-03 09:56:49.355312+00	170	kết hợp với nhiệt nhằm tạo cảm giác thư giãn cho các vùng cơ sau khi làm việc hoặc vận động.\n\n### **Đấm lưng thảo dược**\n\nĐấm lưng kết hợp các loại thảo dược như ngải cứu giúp người dùng massage nhẹ nhàng vùng vai, cổ và lưng sau một ngày làm việc.\n\n### **Tinh dầu thiên nhiên**\n\nTinh dầu có hương ngải cứu hoặc kết hợp với các loại thảo dược khác thường được sử dụng trong phòng ngủ hoặc không gian làm việc để tạo cảm giác thư giãn.\n\n## **Cách sử dụng các sản phẩm chứa ngải cứu hiệu quả**\n\nĐể tận dụng tốt những lợi ích từ các sản phẩm **ngải cứu giảm đau**, bạn nên:	[0.012550354,0.0041122437,-0.0289917,0.015129089,0.013748169,-0.042541504,-0.02809143,0.030700684,0.030975342,-0.014633179,-0.009857178,0.026123047,-0.024734497,-0.018936157,0.02748108,0.02571106,-0.010345459,-0.010795593,0.00198555,-0.016616821,-0.0038337708,0.041229248,-0.02281189,0.014541626,0.010414124,-0.032684326,0.012557983,0.046051025,-0.005722046,-0.021057129,-0.0056762695,-0.026824951,0.054901123,-9.860992E-4,0.024505615,0.05545044,-0.028930664,0.032226562,-0.012580872,-0.05014038,0.016021729,0.01802063,-0.01108551,0.008026123,-0.01751709,0.002243042,-0.007572174,0.022872925,0.02381897,-5.950928E-4,0.034210205,-0.054473877,0.006362915,0.050201416,0.010284424,-0.007347107,-0.019088745,-0.014518738,0.031677246,-0.014549255,0.0011882782,-0.0059661865,0.0011787415,0.039398193,-0.0692749,-0.006454468,-0.016845703,-0.06359863,-0.0055007935,-0.0209198,-0.016281128,-0.0021762848,0.015930176,0.03314209,0.009475708,-0.055664062,-0.024215698,0.020477295,0.026382446,-0.0068969727,0.0041503906,0.008995056,0.005168915,0.014183044,-0.03842163,-0.05404663,-0.05230713,0.06311035,-0.06210327,-0.010429382,-0.013954163,0.050354004,0.02671814,-0.006011963,-0.02154541,0.030731201,0.018737793,-0.060394287,-0.016220093,0.04425049,0.008560181,-0.014877319,0.032104492,0.0070877075,0.022750854,-0.033813477,0.014