d233b4fc-685c-4636-99b1-57bf2d84e7e6	2026-07-03 09:56:56.082517+00	2026-07-03 09:56:56.082517+00	179	* Nếu cơn đau kéo dài hoặc nghiêm trọng, hãy đến cơ sở y tế để được thăm khám.\n\nCác sản phẩm chứa ngải cứu phù hợp với mục đích hỗ trợ thư giãn và chăm sóc sức khỏe hằng ngày, không phải là sản phẩm điều trị bệnh.\n\n## **Câu hỏi thường gặp**\n\n### **Ngải cứu giảm đau có thực sự hiệu quả không?**\n\nNgải cứu từ lâu đã được sử dụng trong các phương pháp chăm sóc sức khỏe truyền thống. Hiện nay, nhiều sản phẩm chứa ngải cứu được sử dụng với mục đích hỗ trợ thư giãn và mang lại cảm giác dễ chịu cho cơ thể. Tuy nhiên, hiệu quả có thể khác nhau tùy từng người và không thay thế phương pháp điều trị y tế.\n\n### **Có thể sử dụng ngải cứu mỗi ngày không?**	[0.013748169,0.020889282,-0.015609741,0.04333496,0.050109863,-0.019088745,-3.8003922E-4,0.021102905,-0.0017127991,-0.018218994,-0.037597656,0.0010471344,-0.04824829,0.006828308,-0.008743286,0.023147583,0.0040893555,0.009963989,-0.011253357,0.0040779114,8.416176E-4,0.044891357,0.039398193,-0.009712219,0.015640259,-0.014312744,0.004837036,0.047912598,0.01197052,-0.018005371,0.004180908,-0.02520752,0.01737976,0.004535675,0.0104522705,0.06137085,-0.0013589859,0.024658203,0.017501831,-0.048950195,0.0038337708,-0.004535675,-0.018829346,-0.0021762848,-0.023834229,0.02394104,-0.011177063,-0.046783447,0.013801575,0.007881165,-0.0058784485,-0.022247314,0.01838684,0.040802002,0.0289917,0.012298584,0.004650116,0.0036411285,0.037200928,-0.048553467,0.02305603,-0.032165527,0.032318115,5.288124E-4,-0.05154419,-0.0064201355,0.014167786,-0.049591064,-0.011764526,-0.003566742,-0.04135132,0.03201294,0.05267334,0.04547119,-0.0050735474,0.014564514,-0.006248474,0.037963867,0.062561035,-0.017440796,-0.025558472,0.03173828,-0.0060310364,0.039520264,0.0010614395,-0.07305908,-0.050964355,0.061157227,-0.01725769,-0.0099105835,-0.025863647,0.05319214,0.016296387,-8.816719E-4,0.0513916,0.018585205,0.0041618347,-0.021469116,0.014144897,0.0046043396