b86b3770-ed5a-4776-ae95-66c0715472cf	2026-07-03 09:57:09.024726+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.024726+00	0	# GỐI CÔNG THÁI HỌC\n\n**Thông tin giá cả sản phẩm trong sheet :[Thông tin Website](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zP_NNUqE-aCRyUJlVbUBJcS2D5DBnEGtr2r0pmnRA0Q/edit?usp=sharing)**\n\n**GỐI CÔNG THÁI HỌC THẢO DƯỢC ( CÓ NHIỆT ) VÀ LOẠI KHÔNG CÓ NHIỆT**  \n  \n\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n### **Phiên bản 1: Gối công thái học thảo dược có nhiệt**\n\n* Tích hợp hệ thống sưởi nhiệt với nhiều mức điều chỉnh.  \n* Làm ấm nhanh, thuận tiện sử dụng tại nhà hoặc văn phòng.  \n* Không tích hợp nam châm massage.\n\n### **Phiên bản 2: Gối công thái học thảo dược không nhiệt**\n\n* Thiết kế tích hợp nam châm massage vùng cổ.  \n* Có thể kết hợp làm nóng bằng các nguồn nhiệt phù hợp nếu cần.  \n* Phù hợp với người yêu thích liệu pháp thư giãn tự nhiên.	[-0.030014038,-0.0033569336,-0.052825928,-0.0435791,0.0259552,-0.035827637,-0.03817749,-0.021881104,0.02822876,-0.062561035,-0.02633667,0.024383545,-0.014755249,0.012397766,0.01737976,0.0121154785,0.010803223,0.0127334595,0.014434814,-0.012283325,0.020629883,0.016586304,-0.01638794,0.044128418,0.020095825,-0.033081055,0.02734375,0.016479492,-0.0074653625,-0.025772095,-0.0058670044,-0.01638794,0.047607422,-0.024291992,0.0038661957,0.037902832,0.0065727234,0.058898926,0.0042877197,-0.013511658,-0.0017337799,0.008125305,-0.02029419,0.03881836,-0.019836426,-0.003293991,-0.035003662,0.004333496,0.029586792,-0.03451538,0.0096588135,-0.04034424,-0.017089844,0.034454346,-0.023498535,0.014541626,-0.03152466,0.0078086853,0.017211914,-0.021438599,-0.012611389,-0.035461426,0.03668213,0.00207901,-0.026947021,-0.01725769,0.009178162,-0.023544312,-0.03845215,0.010551453,0.0069503784,0.009742737,0.020065308,-0.008506775,-0.016555786,0.0012798309,-0.0637207,-0.0036258698,0.023376465,-0.039978027,0.015159607,-0.004432678,0.02796936,0.022064209,-0.06750488