4d775230-f1d8-4bd8-96d9-cb7fe796d4e6	2026-07-03 09:57:09.025311+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.025311+00	1	# **Mô tả sản phẩm** \n\n**Gối Công Thái Học Thảo Dược NaHerbs** được thiết kế dựa trên đường cong tự nhiên của cột sống cổ, giúp nâng đỡ vùng đầu, cổ và vai trong suốt quá trình nghỉ ngơi. Thiết kế công thái học giúp duy trì tư thế nằm đúng, mang lại cảm giác thoải mái khi ngủ hoặc thư giãn.\n\nĐiểm đặc biệt của sản phẩm là **lớp túi thảo dược thiên nhiên** được đặt bên trong gối. Người dùng có thể dễ dàng tháo rời túi thảo dược để vệ sinh vỏ gối hoặc thay thế lõi thảo dược mới sau thời gian sử dụng, giúp sản phẩm luôn sạch sẽ và đảm bảo hương thơm tự nhiên.\n\nSản phẩm được phát triển với **hai phiên bản** gồm **có nhiệt** và **không nhiệt**, đáp ứng đa dạng nhu cầu của người sử dụng.\n\nKích thước : 35x57	[-0.018096924,0.024551392,-0.03692627,-0.0019292831,0.016204834,-0.037231445,-0.033081055,0.04168701,0.040283203,-0.030914307,-0.02407837,-0.010307312,-0.03479004,-0.016616821,0.031707764,-0.020965576,-0.005329132,-0.043273926,-0.010398865,0.0146102905,0.008972168,0.052978516,0.055908203,0.0058937073,0.038848877,-0.035980225,0.023788452,0.012519836,0.0062942505,-0.0040779114,-0.0060195923,-0.03326416,0.052520752,-0.031341553,0.02670288,0.022964478,0.0138168335,0.01864624,0.017028809,-0.006893158,0.0023555756,0.010276794,0.0010385513,-4.762411E-5,-0.018341064,0.0093307495,0.014480591,0.0357666,0.01108551,-0.0041046143,0.026748657,-0.020980835,-0.039520264,0.03463745,-0.01525116,-0.0048179626,-0.015396118,0.044769287,-8.893013E-4,-0.009277344,-0.027832031,-0.064208984,0.0048446655,0.04550171,-0.049926758,-0.0035476685,-0.0020103455,-0.028503418,-0.010055542,-0.0051994324,-0.0073661804,-0.0074501038,-0.03729248,0.029205322,-0.02720642,-0.009056091,-0.051635742,0.00630188,0.031204224,-0.0178833,-0.012550354,0.018554688,0.0138168335,0.030593872,-0.021530151,-0.033996582,-0.053497314,-0.0050582886,-0.060943604,0.0077056885,0.0020866394,0.0025539398,0.06512451,-0.01398468