9ec02ef4-6b12-43b4-8ca6-f15e1920cac1	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026183+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026183+00	5	# CHƯỜM ĐA NĂG SIZE BÉ\n\n  \n  \n**Tên sản phẩm : Túi Chườm Đa Năng Thảo Dược NaHerbs – Có Nhiệt & Không Nhiệt**\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n### **Phiên bản Có Nhiệt**\n\n* Tích hợp hệ thống làm nóng thông minh.  \n* 3 mức nhiệt điều chỉnh phù hợp với từng nhu cầu sử dụng.  \n* Làm nóng nhanh, sử dụng tiện lợi tại nhà, văn phòng hoặc khi đi công tác.  \n* Không cần làm nóng thủ công trước khi sử dụng.\n\n### **Phiên bản Không Nhiệt**\n\n* Thiết kế gọn nhẹ, tiết kiệm chi phí.  \n* Có thể làm nóng bằng **lò vi sóng, nồi cơm, chảo hoặc các nguồn nhiệt phù hợp**.  \n* Khi được làm ấm, hương thơm thảo dược lan tỏa tự nhiên, mang lại cảm giác thư giãn dễ chịu.  \n* Dễ dàng sử dụng mọi lúc, mọi nơi.	[-0.016906738,0.0016975403,-0.06149292,-0.03845215,0.049682617,-0.017059326,-0.026473999,0.0074272156,0.017868042,-0.045715332,-0.06329346,0.014625549,-0.024124146,0.02684021,0.01878357,0.008865356,0.00308609,-0.004802704,-0.032196045,-0.011817932,-0.022445679,0.04925537,-0.008842468,0.026550293,0.025421143,-0.029449463,-0.0019054413,-0.015007019,0.033477783,-0.011161804,-0.018096924,-0.031707764,0.037902832,-0.0073509216,0.037963867,0.015151978,-0.010940552,0.024780273,-0.006412506,-0.016662598,-0.0073661804,-0.007911682,-0.007434845,0.04660034,-0.025100708,0.03253174,-9.613037E-4,0.02444458,0.017959595,0.009605408,0.0385437,-0.025161743,-0.017120361,0.011657715,0.011062622,-0.0010318756,-0.043029785,0.06335449,0.008392334,-0.0065307617,-0.015220642,-0.036254883,0.002620697,0.06237793,-0.038635254,-0.0082092285,-0.020935059,-0.05545044,-0.03643799,0.01802063,-0.0032958984,-0.015960693,2.8657913E-4,0.008148193,-0.024490356,0.03289795,-0.070617676,-0.03955078,0.0362854,-0.028533936,-0.03225708,0.011291504,0.022460938,-8.1920624E-4,-0.0052833557,-0.064575195,-0.039398193,0.031402588,-0.08355713,-0.0163116