e178c903-4870-4d4b-a2e2-f0dd79620baa	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026357+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026357+00	6	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Túi Chườm Đa Năng Thảo Dược NaHerbs** được thiết kế với kích thước **12 × 25 cm**, nhỏ gọn nhưng đủ diện tích để sử dụng cho nhiều vùng trên cơ thể như **cổ, vai, gáy, lưng, bụng, đầu gối, khuỷu tay hoặc các nhóm cơ thường xuyên bị đau mỏi.**\n\nSản phẩm sử dụng **100% thảo dược thiên nhiên**, kết hợp cùng lớp vải mềm mại, thân thiện với làn da và có khả năng giữ nhiệt tốt.\n\nĐiểm nổi bật của sản phẩm là **lõi thảo dược có thể tháo rời**, giúp người dùng dễ dàng vệ sinh vỏ túi cũng như thay lõi thảo dược mới sau thời gian dài sử dụng.\n\nNaHerbs phát triển **hai phiên bản Có Nhiệt và Không Có Nhiệt**, giúp người dùng dễ dàng lựa chọn theo nhu cầu và ngân sách.	[0.011253357,0.023162842,-0.029144287,0.016326904,0.04498291,-0.015144348,-0.054779053,0.015686035,0.020584106,-0.01940918,-0.047088623,5.4073334E-4,-0.03857422,0.005680084,0.053710938,0.0032539368,-0.001461029,-0.004180908,-0.043762207,-1.2910366E-4,0.031433105,0.06427002,2.1648407E-4,0.024291992,0.028167725,-0.03387451,0.01008606,-0.009567261,0.036590576,-0.0056648254,0.002527237,-0.027160645,0.05303955,0.015930176,0.025482178,0.024169922,-0.011489868,0.024795532,-0.010803223,-0.029647827,0.017181396,0.022445679,-0.009895325,-0.002954483,-0.0015630722,0.022033691,-0.0101623535,0.014831543,0.017150879,0.0059814453,0.02281189,-0.014526367,-0.007820129,-0.018447876,-0.019363403,-0.0034809113,-0.042419434,0.048553467,-0.003648758,-0.009887695,-0.0027694702,-0.055725098,-0.0015172958,0.05340576,-0.0647583,-0.008285522,-0.0011835098,-0.03692627,-0.012939453,-0.0082473755,0.013847351,0.018997192,-0.0013694763,0.039245605,-0.009643555,0.012962341,-0.059570312,-0.01737976,0.010894775,-0.024597168,-0.040649414,0.008934021,0.004638672,0.028625488,-0.017288208,-0.04031372,-0.033721924,0.025009155,-0.089904785,-0.008430481,0.010795593,-0.011405945,0.058441162,-0.008659363,0.028213501,-0.0013160706