9fb8d649-b3cf-437e-856c-2967f1c53949	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026608+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026608+00	7	# **Nếu bạn đang gặp những tình trạng sau**\n\n* Đau mỏi cổ, vai, gáy sau nhiều giờ làm việc.  \n* Đau lưng do ngồi lâu hoặc ít vận động.  \n* Mỏi cơ sau khi chơi thể thao hoặc lao động.  \n* Căng cứng cơ thể sau một ngày làm việc.  \n* Người lớn tuổi thường xuyên cảm thấy đau nhức xương khớp.  \n* Phụ nữ đau bụng trong kỳ kinh nguyệt.  \n* Muốn thư giãn cơ thể sau những ngày căng thẳng.\n\nThì **Túi Chườm Đa Năng Thảo Dược NaHerbs** là một lựa chọn phù hợp để đồng hành cùng bạn trong việc chăm sóc sức khỏe hằng ngày.	[-0.026443481,0.045684814,0.0061302185,0.035003662,0.033355713,-0.033081055,-0.013893127,0.026519775,0.010505676,-0.0027770996,-0.032592773,0.03253174,-0.053741455,-0.030517578,0.026931763,0.008049011,0.013977051,-0.02079773,-0.002199173,-0.0029830933,0.05517578,0.053222656,0.005996704,-9.98497E-4,-4.1127205E-4,-0.005844116,0.008216858,0.009819031,0.009300232,-0.011680603,0.0011663437,-0.025680542,0.02607727,0.015151978,0.031311035,0.057861328,0.010246277,0.045318604,0.0022697449,-0.0546875,0.022766113,0.025985718,0.03173828,-0.00907135,-0.030227661,-7.87735E-4,-0.027374268,0.0107421875,0.0413208,0.008872986,-0.015655518,-0.021316528,0.026107788,0.07220459,0.028137207,-0.011360168,-6.637573E-4,0.028625488,0.022583008,0.0064468384,-0.0011968613,0.018722534,-0.0107421875,0.012176514,-0.06048584,-0.024490356,0.023010254,-0.036621094,-0.030166626,0.0049552917,-0.048461914,0.030471802,0.042541504,0.067993164,0.0077285767,-0.018722534,-0.034423828,-1.5354156E-4,0.035003662,-0.04626465,-0.004501343,-0.017471313,-0.011039734,0.04663086,-0.026947021,-0.06414795,-0.048553467,0.04257202,-0.040740967,-7.209778E-4,0.0042686462,-8.401871E-4,0.017471313,0.0056381226,0.022766113,8.955002E-4,-0.0026474,-0.068847656,-0.015045166,-0.005443573,7.0524216E-4,-0.02394104,0.020935059,-0.009223938,0.012481689,-0.017059326,-0.0115737915,0.034210205,-0.058746338,0.049194336,-0.0260