446336c4-0d23-4b26-9887-b78477d9a3be	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026807+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.026807+00	8	# **Công dụng**\n\nDưới tác động của nhiệt (đối với phiên bản có nhiệt hoặc sau khi làm nóng), kết hợp cùng hương thơm từ các loại thảo dược thiên nhiên, sản phẩm mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và dễ chịu.\n\nSản phẩm hỗ trợ:\n\n* Làm ấm vùng cơ thể cần thư giãn.  \n* Hỗ trợ giảm cảm giác đau mỏi ở cổ, vai, gáy, lưng và các nhóm cơ sau thời gian làm việc hoặc vận động.  \n* Hỗ trợ thư giãn cơ, giảm cảm giác căng cứng.  \n* Mang lại cảm giác dễ chịu, giúp cơ thể được nghỉ ngơi sau ngày dài.  \n* Hương thơm từ thảo dược giúp tạo không gian thư giãn và thoải mái.  \n* Có thể sử dụng chườm nóng hoặc chườm lạnh tùy mục đích sử dụng.	[0.01411438,-0.0104904175,-0.059509277,-0.0012731552,0.03414917,-0.03640747,-0.029373169,6.041527E-4,0.021240234,-0.020828247,-0.026168823,0.05508423,-0.030838013,-0.0051956177,0.018936157,0.007572174,-0.0047683716,0.0065727234,-0.00579834,0.017456055,0.0035495758,0.055267334,-0.04171753,0.014373779,0.018325806,-0.011657715,-0.03778076,0.0036792755,0.03164673,-0.05239868,-0.042266846,-0.01878357,0.04534912,-0.013465881,0.050354004,0.051116943,-0.012107849,-0.009635925,-0.01235199,-0.027236938,0.00217247,0.0017166138,-0.05041504,0.009185791,-0.04159546,-0.0088272095,-0.035888672,0.04333496,0.03048706,-0.004055023,0.07019043,-0.0118637085,0.028717041,0.032226562,0.0107803345,-0.0034770966,0.015838623,0.0059547424,-0.013076782,4.1294098E-4,9.0646744E-4,-0.012245178,-0.0131073,0.03149414,-0.05606079,0.0077171326,-0.0055770874,-0.048828125,-0.006023407,-0.00806427,-0.018112183,-0.017807007,0.014556885,0.022064209,-0.013130188,-0.019119263,-0.022079468,-0.032165527,0.0395813,-0.04776001,-0.01109314,0.010032654,0.00233078,0.027328491,0.005065918,-0.06921387,-0.052001953,0.062805176,-0.07159424,-0.003648758,0.022994995,0.058929443,0.036346436,-0.033996582,0.0143966675,0.012954712,-0.0121536255,-0.056671143,-0.02432251,0.029052734,0.0027942657,-0.0048561096,