f4887228-7372-4d6c-b120-ec538e691b29	2026-07-03 09:57:09.027192+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.027192+00	10	# **Hướng dẫn sử dụng**\n\n## **Phiên bản Có Nhiệt**\n\n* Kết nối nguồn điện.  \n* Chọn 1 trong 3 mức nhiệt phù hợp.  \n* Đặt sản phẩm lên vùng cơ thể cần thư giãn từ **15–30 phút/lần**.  \n* Ngắt nguồn sau khi sử dụng.\n\n## **Phiên bản Không Có Nhiệt**\n\n### **Chườm nóng**\n\n* Làm nóng bằng **lò vi sóng, nồi cơm, chảo hoặc nguồn nhiệt phù hợp**.  \n* Kiểm tra nhiệt độ trước khi sử dụng.  \n* Chườm lên vùng cơ thể cần thư giãn khoảng **15–20 phút**.\n\n### **Chườm lạnh**\n\n* Cho túi vào túi zip kín.  \n* Đặt trong ngăn đá khoảng **1–2 giờ**.  \n* Lấy ra và sử dụng.	[-0.023498535,-5.6505203E-4,-0.06365967,-0.045654297,0.026306152,-0.027954102,-0.033813477,0.0022449493,0.0345459,-0.049224854,-0.03604126,0.031143188,-0.012123108,0.033599854,0.012504578,-0.0035076141,-0.018493652,0.023132324,-0.006958008,-0.0077400208,-0.017227173,0.06427002,0.0029582977,0.041107178,0.015220642,0.01335907,0.006877899,0.02330017,0.02178955,-0.03164673,-0.037506104,-0.014251709,0.02960205,-0.034606934,0.046173096,0.024429321,-0.016067505,0.053955078,-0.0140686035,-8.792877E-4,-0.019882202,-0.01725769,-0.04232788,-0.0038433075,-0.0037384033,-0.0017538071,-0.04989624,-0.011650085,0.028625488,-0.0069618225,0.051971436,-0.008926392,0.012420654,-0.017608643,0.007896423,-0.0062713623,0.024734497,0.018234253,0.026977539,-0.007461548,0.005443573,-0.015823364,0.017303467,0.06951904,-0.002199173,0.0029239655,-0.004535675,-0.026290894,-0.025314331,0.009269714,-0.042236328,0.01158905,0.025512695,-0.007896423,0.002790451,0.033050537,-0.06161499,-0.017745972,0.03842163,-0.013702393,-0.01373291,0.0015382767,0.0015296936,0.021469116,-0.041229248,-0.0395813,-0.061401367,0.025878906,-0.07562256,-0.049072266,-0.028579712,0.03604126,0.025817871,-0.049835205,-0.001502037,0.016860962,0.0032215118,-0.0234375,-0.00907135,0.046661377,0.049438477,0.016860962,0.020736694,-0.015159607,0.049224854,0.0010938644,-0.0