2b77a6bc-b8e8-48eb-aa04-ff9016f8139a	2026-07-03 09:57:09.028137+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.028137+00	15	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Gối Đa Năng Thảo Dược NaHerbs** được thiết kế với kích thước **23 × 36 cm**, phù hợp sử dụng cho nhiều vùng trên cơ thể như **cổ, vai, gáy, lưng, bụng, đầu gối và các nhóm cơ thường xuyên bị đau mỏi.** \n\nKhác với túi chườm thông thường, sản phẩm sử dụng cấu trúc **40% lõi thảo dược thiên nhiên kết hợp cùng 60% bông mềm cao cấp**, giúp gối vừa mang lại cảm giác êm ái khi sử dụng, vừa giữ được hương thơm dịu nhẹ của thảo dược.\n\nLõi thảo dược được thiết kế **tháo rời**, giúp người dùng dễ dàng vệ sinh vỏ gối và thay thế lõi mới sau thời gian sử dụng, góp phần kéo dài tuổi thọ sản phẩm.\n\nSản phẩm có hai phiên bản **Có Nhiệt** và **Không Có Nhiệt**, đáp ứng đa dạng nhu cầu chăm sóc sức khỏe và thư giãn hằng ngày.	[-0.0066986084,0.03643799,-0.010757446,-0.0052948,0.021331787,-0.019012451,-0.060394287,0.034942627,0.02935791,-0.028244019,-0.0335083,0.004486084,-0.036346436,-0.027053833,0.0155181885,-0.015792847,0.0129852295,-0.013633728,-0.03475952,0.005832672,0.03475952,0.07147217,0.032348633,-0.0066833496,0.034820557,-0.0104522705,0.036712646,7.185936E-4,0.025680542,-0.00881958,-0.003293991,-0.026657104,0.0592041,-0.012710571,0.025100708,0.01763916,7.557869E-4,0.021224976,0.01777649,-0.01776123,0.00440979,0.023162842,-0.01272583,0.006389618,-0.005962372,0.02949524,0.031555176,0.016525269,0.012252808,3.604889E-4,0.025756836,-0.0151901245,-0.019973755,0.025146484,0.016296387,-0.006248474,-0.030731201,0.05895996,0.014762878,-0.010093689,-0.027069092,-0.06707764,0.01550293,0.060516357,-0.06817627,6.933212E-4,0.0010471344,-0.02432251,-0.003364563,0.0038318634,-0.0024528503,0.0028915405,0.005836487,0.033569336,-0.015640259,0.022888184,-0.06201172,-0.028045654,0.026397705,-0.018753052,-0.032684326,0.012481689,-0.0061950684,0.032043457,-0.008300781,-0.041534424,-0.030929565,0.022750854,-0.073791504,0.024398804,0.005584717,-0.032104492,0.079589844,-0.