b8fcaccc-da26-42bc-b936-a56c90773d30	2026-07-03 09:57:09.029452+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.029452+00	21	# **Tại sao nên chọn Gối Đa Năng Thảo Dược NaHerbs?**\n\n✅ Thiết kế đa năng, sử dụng linh hoạt cho nhiều vùng cơ thể.\n\n✅ Kích thước lớn **23 × 36 cm**, mang lại cảm giác ôm sát và thoải mái hơn.\n\n✅ **40% thảo dược thiên nhiên kết hợp 60% bông mềm cao cấp**, cân bằng giữa sự thư giãn và độ êm ái.\n\n✅ Lõi thảo dược có thể tháo rời để vệ sinh và thay thế.\n\n✅ Hai phiên bản **Có Nhiệt** và **Không Có Nhiệt** đáp ứng nhiều nhu cầu sử dụng.\n\n✅ Hai màu sắc trang nhã **Be** và **Nâu**, phù hợp với nhiều phong cách không gian sống.	[-0.011505127,0.02960205,-0.0024032593,0.014663696,0.06097412,-0.017242432,-0.08880615,0.03955078,0.0052452087,0.009536743,-0.02949524,0.020126343,-0.035369873,-0.0016651154,0.030929565,-0.02633667,-0.0109939575,-0.032989502,-0.024383545,-0.019897461,0.03277588,0.08892822,0.011375427,-0.012641907,0.030807495,-0.014419556,0.030517578,-0.011070251,0.015274048,-0.021560669,-0.037384033,-0.024124146,0.057495117,-0.01737976,0.005142212,0.016616821,0.015365601,0.002937317,-0.005897522,-0.019241333,-0.0074386597,0.016601562,0.0051460266,0.030334473,0.0021839142,0.023727417,0.017349243,-0.008132935,0.014816284,0.005344391,0.0026435852,-0.024490356,-0.013587952,0.021881104,0.0155181885,-0.015235901,-0.053741455,0.04345703,0.0096206665,-0.0036773682,-0.02658081,-0.052520752,0.012130737,0.0692749,-0.051116943,-0.0023078918,-0.005886078,-0.028747559,0.012374878,0.017074585,-0.008155823,0.008834839,-0.0048179626,0.03363037,-0.014503479,0.029266357,-0.04260254,-0.012619019,0.019577026,-0.03640747,-0.032196045,0.004573822,-0.008964539,0.031921387,-0.020492554,-0.072143555,0.007972717,-0.0047302246,-0.08203125,0.0018882751,0.035491943,-0.01637268,0.05722046,-0.024291992,0.011894226,-0.0046653748,0.0022697449,-0.05847168,-0.027374268,0.020263672,0.012817383,-0.03869629,-0.0062942505,0.039398193,-0.006210327,-0.0041542053,-0.001991272,0.06384277,-0.054504395,