d75f2ec4-bea3-4a99-8d94-4809322f65df	2026-07-03 09:57:09.029876+00	2026-07-03 09:57:09.029876+00	23	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Cốc Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu NaHerbs** là bộ dụng cụ hỗ trợ xông ngải theo phương pháp Đông y, được thiết kế nhỏ gọn, an toàn và tiện lợi để sử dụng ngay tại nhà.\n\nSản phẩm được sử dụng kết hợp với **điếu ngải cứu thảo dược**, tạo nguồn nhiệt cùng hương thơm tự nhiên của ngải cứu, giúp mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và làm ấm vùng cơ thể cần chăm sóc.\n\nVới thiết kế bằng gốm sứ chịu nhiệt kết hợp **vỏ bọc chống nóng**, sản phẩm giúp người dùng dễ dàng cầm nắm trong quá trình sử dụng. Chặn tàn Inox đi kèm giúp cố định điếu ngải và hạn chế tro rơi ra ngoài, tăng tính an toàn và tiện lợi.\n\nKích thước nhỏ gọn giúp người dùng có thể mang theo khi đi làm, đi công tác hoặc sử dụng ngay tại nhà.	[-0.008216858,0.013900757,-0.03302002,-3.7622452E-4,0.03451538,-0.017868042,-0.056915283,0.025497437,0.009841919,-0.04626465,-0.012542725,-0.01361084,-0.034606934,0.017486572,0.024993896,-0.009735107,-0.03201294,-0.01586914,-0.021255493,0.022735596,-0.032318115,0.05114746,0.03616333,0.01663208,0.019241333,-0.03668213,-0.003479004,0.067993164,0.012107849,-0.019638062,-0.011070251,-0.022491455,0.026031494,-0.004825592,0.02571106,0.029754639,0.033966064,-0.015777588,-0.016815186,0.0025787354,-0.0027599335,-0.029586792,-0.004562378,0.024459839,-0.011810303,0.045715332,-0.008216858,-0.007030487,-0.0037517548,0.031799316,0.036468506,-0.015716553,-0.028701782,0.021575928,0.016036987,-5.264282E-4,-0.005596161,0.038513184,0.005130768,-0.023956299,-0.06060791,-0.06817627,0.013595581,0.062164307,-0.026733398,0.02330017,0.011009216,-0.04019165,-0.013679504,-0.019851685,0.011116028,-0.012588501,-0.030761719,-0.009803772,-0.00466156,-0.011924744,-0.07598877,-0.020950317,0.010276794,-0.032073975,-0.027923584,0.012283325,-0.007751465,0.002840042,0.026138306,-0.02897644,-0.044952393,0.03717041,-0.05432129,-0.01008606,-0.0104904175,0.028930664,0.03656006,-0.034851074,0.039855957,0.0