6a6630e9-6711-4398-93da-17ff3a4af825	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227032+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227032+00	25	# **Công dụng**\n\nKhi sử dụng cùng **điếu ngải cứu**, nguồn nhiệt kết hợp với hương thơm từ thảo dược giúp:\n\n* **Giảm đau và căng cơ:** Nhiệt nóng giúp thư giãn cơ bắp, giảm đau nhức cổ vai gáy, đau lưng, tê bì chân tay hoặc các vết bầm tím.   \n* **Kích thích tuần hoàn máu:** Hơi ấm làm giãn nở mạch máu, giúp khí huyết lưu thông tốt hơn, từ đó tăng cường trao đổi chất và phục hồi sức khỏe.   \n* **Bổ sung dương khí và trừ hàn:** Theo Y học cổ truyền, liệu pháp này giúp đẩy lùi hàn khí (lạnh) ra khỏi cơ thể, hỗ trợ trị cảm lạnh và giảm đau bụng kinh.  \n* **Thư giãn, giảm stress:** Hương thơm tự nhiên từ ngải cứu giúp làm dịu tâm trí, giảm căng thẳng và hỗ trợ cải thiện chất lượng giấc ngủ.	[-0.027420044,-0.009666443,-0.031433105,0.0066871643,0.037322998,-0.045959473,-0.060668945,0.023956299,0.016723633,-0.027557373,-0.037597656,0.057250977,-0.03652954,0.013801575,0.023223877,0.037384033,-0.026916504,0.018920898,0.007751465,-0.014450073,-0.014083862,0.049957275,0.011047363,0.035308838,0.02229309,-0.016815186,0.0039711,0.038879395,0.037902832,-0.022003174,-0.014373779,-0.024902344,0.02558899,-0.009284973,0.016143799,0.09106445,-0.014526367,-0.009147644,-0.040008545,-0.05130005,0.016571045,-0.03363037,-0.031463623,0.021484375,-0.029449463,0.015594482,-0.008605957,-0.0054740906,0.027191162,0.021514893,0.029067993,-0.034484863,0.008216858,0.041656494,0.013084412,-0.0018033981,0.017364502,0.0075302124,-0.006500244,-0.018936157,-0.010009766,-0.01701355,-0.00856781,0.020050049,-0.024383545,0.031036377,0.011817932,-0.051452637,-0.018585205,0.015144348,-0.01247406,-0.0014696121,0.056671143,0.020446777,0.0040626526,0.0010728836,-0.027679443,0.0025806427,0.009597778,-0.034240723,2.2828579E-4,0.01739502,-0.0023155212,0.0016717911,-0.0137786865,-0.06378174,-0.05807495,0.072387695,-0.07647705,0.010551453,-0.032318115,0.03286743,0.00945282,-0.021881104,0.012680054,0.019317627,0.0