b839dbe5-2b66-47a7-ae69-fea688c4e1b3	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227503+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227503+00	27	# **Hướng dẫn sử dụng**\n\n1. Đặt điếu ngải cứu vào trong cốc và cố định bằng chặn tàn Inox.  \n2. Châm cháy đầu điếu ngải theo hướng dẫn.  \n3. Đặt cốc lên vùng cơ thể cần làm ấm hoặc thư giãn.  \n4. Di chuyển nhẹ nhàng theo vùng cần chăm sóc hoặc giữ cố định trong thời gian phù hợp.  \n5. Sau khi sử dụng, dập tắt điếu ngải và để cốc nguội hoàn toàn trước khi cất giữ.\n\n**Lưu ý khi sử dụng:**\n\n* Cốc có thể đạt nhiệt độ cao, nên đặt trong túi bọc bảo vệ (thường đi kèm) và di chuyển đều tay trên da để tránh bị bỏng.  \n* Không hơ ngải cứu lên các vùng có vết thương hở, da đang bị viêm loét hoặc phụ nữ có thai (vùng bụng, lưng dưới).  \n* Không sử dụng cho trẻ nhỏ nếu không có người lớn giám sát.  \n* Bảo quản nơi khô ráo, tránh va đập mạnh.	[0.022262573,0.039001465,-0.04071045,-0.03414917,0.040771484,-0.051605225,-0.021316528,-0.026535034,-0.0013990402,-0.045959473,0.02168274,-0.009239197,-0.027114868,0.017791748,0.058624268,0.009147644,-0.03451538,-0.01939392,-0.00674057,0.020874023,-0.04244995,0.06225586,0.038238525,0.02684021,2.1624565E-4,-0.03378296,0.06335449,0.05935669,0.0084991455,-0.011329651,-0.035369873,-0.016601562,-0.005455017,-0.012107849,0.04724121,0.054382324,0.015716553,0.022262573,-0.04058838,-0.041046143,-2.1362305E-4,-0.037231445,0.019180298,-0.02709961,-0.016784668,0.039520264,0.0013170242,-0.011222839,0.022506714,0.0024051666,0.061157227,8.3065033E-4,-0.003408432,0.038391113,0.01789856,-0.017837524,0.0103302,0.0135650635,0.01739502,-0.045654297,-0.014221191,-0.019226074,0.023483276,0.044891357,-0.011833191,-0.0026168823,-0.024642944,-0.0029258728,-0.014373779,-0.014312744,0.0014600754,-0.037902832,-0.013557434,-0.010406494,0.0010023117,-0.020858765,-0.030761719,-0.029937744,-0.008422852,-0.0021076202,-0.0011835098,0.0013952255,-0.028900146,0.034851074,-0.007205963,0.006755829,-0.036865234,0.01121521,-0.03149414,-0.02078247,-0.0546875,0.044189453