6d698fdb-0664-44c7-af7b-4567676e3cf8	2026-07-03 09:57:21.22765+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.22765+00	28	# **Tại sao nên chọn Cốc Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu NaHerbs?**\n\n✅ Thiết kế gốm sứ chịu nhiệt, bền và an toàn.\n\n✅ Vỏ bọc chống nóng giúp cầm nắm dễ dàng.\n\n✅ Chặn tàn Inox tăng tính an toàn khi sử dụng.\n\n✅ Kích thước nhỏ gọn, tiện lợi mang theo.\n\n✅ Phù hợp sử dụng tại nhà, spa và cơ sở chăm sóc sức khỏe.\n\n✅ Đồng bộ cùng **Điếu Ngải Cứu NaHerbs**, mang đến trải nghiệm chăm sóc sức khỏe từ thảo dược thiên nhiên.	[-0.006664276,-0.0049476624,-0.0017557144,0.0016069412,0.072509766,-0.040985107,-0.091308594,0.016967773,0.018447876,-0.04748535,-0.016418457,0.006362915,-0.037719727,0.039764404,0.007987976,-0.01890564,-0.026306152,-0.02722168,-0.032989502,-0.00819397,-0.028823853,0.080322266,0.016113281,-0.008483887,0.015808105,-0.052337646,-0.011016846,0.049804688,0.020858765,-0.024002075,-0.025985718,-0.017120361,0.02532959,0.013069153,-0.0046958923,0.020339966,0.008125305,-0.019042969,-0.025756836,-0.008087158,-0.0018415451,0.0082473755,-0.009994507,0.027053833,0.024093628,0.027160645,-0.019119263,-0.0231781,-0.01259613,0.017471313,0.024795532,-0.011520386,-0.012260437,0.033447266,0.0061912537,-0.018127441,-0.03213501,0.035583496,0.013114929,0.0074310303,-0.047058105,-0.057739258,-0.014823914,0.041778564,-0.003452301,0.023620605,-0.01953125,-0.05758667,-0.010269165,0.0063667297,-0.014717102,0.0013484955,-0.0031356812,0.030471802,-0.022354126,-0.020309448,-0.05102539,-0.023345947,0.026473999,-0.015899658,-0.027023315,0.015449524,0.014945984,0.027374268,0.02760315,-0.046173096,-0.008140564,0.04675293,-0.07244873,6.532669E-4,0.015853882,0.024017334,0.023834229,-0.028060913,0.02909851,-8.568764E-4,0.017608643,-0.03878784,-0.014030457,0.043945312,0.011627197,-0.057678223,0.025894165,0.026138306,0.021911621,-0.022720337,0.0054969788,0.03729248,-0.039642334,0.039001465,0.021759033,-0.019760132,-0.0037212372,0.00969696,-0.026306152,0.004310608,-0.022399902,0.050994873,0.020690918,0.