fb8fbb5d-2bf9-4ccd-bc4c-4fbbba63e5e8	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227909+00	2026-07-03 09:57:21.227909+00	30	# **Mô tả sản phẩm**\n\n**Dụng Cụ Cầm Tay Xông Hơi Ngải Cứu NaHerbs** là thiết bị hỗ trợ xông ngải theo phương pháp Đông y, được thiết kế với **tay cầm dài bằng gỗ tự nhiên**, giúp người dùng dễ dàng thao tác và chủ động chăm sóc nhiều vùng trên cơ thể.\n\nSản phẩm sử dụng kết hợp với **điếu ngải cứu thảo dược NaHerbs**, tạo nguồn nhiệt cùng hương thơm tự nhiên của ngải cứu, mang lại cảm giác thư giãn và làm ấm cơ thể.\n\nSo với cốc xông hơi truyền thống, dụng cụ cầm tay giúp **di chuyển linh hoạt** đến nhiều vị trí như cổ, vai, gáy, lưng, eo, chân và cánh tay, đồng thời hạn chế việc phải giữ cố định một vị trí trong suốt quá trình sử dụng.\n\nPhần đầu dụng cụ được trang bị **lưới chắn inox chịu nhiệt**, giúp cố định điếu ngải, hạn chế tàn rơi và tăng độ an toàn trong quá trình xông.	[0.0061073303,0.021209717,-0.017944336,0.014640808,0.018371582,-0.010131836,-0.050476074,0.01928711,0.030960083,-0.0259552,-0.0034446716,-0.012535095,-0.056549072,0.02897644,0.031982422,-0.005420685,-0.046447754,-0.014839172,-0.00687027,-0.0018234253,-0.026931763,0.055236816,0.029541016,0.008850098,0.019119263,-0.054748535,-0.005432129,0.076171875,-0.003917694,-0.0022468567,0.005176544,-0.029815674,0.023452759,0.0022335052,0.025314331,0.025375366,0.007587433,-0.006919861,-0.022384644,-0.0028858185,-0.004962921,-0.022949219,-0.025558472,0.008331299,-0.019241333,0.03475952,-0.037353516,0.016677856,-0.003314972,0.041503906,0.037078857,0.0010766983,-0.035461426,0.02671814,0.023895264,-0.011192322,0.0052452087,0.039489746,-0.016998291,-0.029541016,-0.058776855,-0.043273926,0.026138306,0.047180176,-0.063964844,0.024963379,-0.01826477,-0.038635254,-0.028961182,-0.0055503845,0.006149292,0.014411926,-0.020339966,0.010848999,0.013648987,-0.026870728,-0.06878662,-0.015853882,0.01411438,-0.011734009,-0.029464722,-0.014923096,-0.014945984,0.0073165894,0.015640259,-0.017211914,-0.036834717,0.0231781,-0